(870936, 99240, 13772, '<td valign="top">Effective B/W. Nice work. I like the cleanliness of this shot. Looks more like an art shot than a porn shot if you know what I mean. Good luck.</td>', 'Effective B/W. Nice work. I like the cleanliness of this shot. Looks more like an art shot than a porn shot if you know what I mean. Good luck.', '2004-08-23 01:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(870948, 98519, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat high key concept.  However, the high key nature of it seems to be contradictory to the theme of the shot.  "Defeat" or despair... death... depression... whatever may be implied here is normally associated with negativity and darkness.  Just something to think about when you are promoting an idea :)  If the elements of the composition are supportive of that theme rather than contradictory, your idea may be better received....</td>', 'This is a neat high key concept.  However, the high key nature of it seems to be contradictory to the theme of the shot.  "Defeat" or despair... death... depression... whatever may be implied here is normally associated with negativity and darkness.  Just something to think about when you are promoting an idea :)  If the elements of the composition are supportive of that theme rather than contradictory, your idea may be better received....', '2004-08-23 01:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(870954, 98901, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m having a problem finding anything particularly interesting in this composition.  Maybe if it was not underexposed, the muscle/texture detail would be a stronger element of the image.  The color itself is not really strong enough to support the entire theme.</td>', 'I''m having a problem finding anything particularly interesting in this composition.  Maybe if it was not underexposed, the muscle/texture detail would be a stronger element of the image.  The color itself is not really strong enough to support the entire theme.', '2004-08-23 01:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
