(871281, 98519, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is a very effective image. There''s a lot of emotion going on. I''m not totally sure what''s going on- suicide? Even so, this has such  emtion and feeling and the  starkness of  the  black and white and the stark contrast  is awesome- 10</td>', 'This is a very effective image. There''s a lot of emotion going on. I''m not totally sure what''s going on- suicide? Even so, this has such  emtion and feeling and the  starkness of  the  black and white and the stark contrast  is awesome- 10', '2004-08-23 05:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(871282, 99076, 25343, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this pic...but I felt like the real focal point of this image should have been the little red painted toe (because you''re not really sure whos it is), which was lost in the motion blur.  If this could not be seen until downloaded, I might even have considered this detail important enough to re-do the set up and re-shoot.  If the toe had gotten the attention it could have, I would have voted this an 8-9!</td>', 'I LOVE this pic...but I felt like the real focal point of this image should have been the little red painted toe (because you''re not really sure whos it is), which was lost in the motion blur.  If this could not be seen until downloaded, I might even have considered this detail important enough to re-do the set up and re-shoot.  If the toe had gotten the attention it could have, I would have voted this an 8-9!', '2004-08-23 05:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(871284, 99401, 14863, '<td valign="top">Dr. Jones, i know this is you and this is a great photo. The complimentary colors of the wall a nd the lingerie is awesome. She has a great expression and I  love teh detail on t he lingerie. Great  job 9</td>', 'Dr. Jones, i know this is you and this is a great photo. The complimentary colors of the wall a nd the lingerie is awesome. She has a great expression and I  love teh detail on t he lingerie. Great  job 9', '2004-08-23 05:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
