(871308, 99337, 7263, '<td valign="top">Honestly, this probably has the most potential out of the lot. The composition and profile is very strong given the body shape of the subject.<br/> <br/>Pose is spot on too and looks ready to burn some rubber. Leaving the socks on just finishes this off and kind of confirms my thoughts of an black comedy picture.<br/> <br/>I would dearly love to see this with more contrast and more thought on the background - perhaps black or brick.<br/> <br/>An 8 as it is.</td>', 'Honestly, this probably has the most potential out of the lot. The composition and profile is very strong given the body shape of the subject. Pose is spot on too and looks ready to burn some rubber. Leaving the socks on just finishes this off and kind of confirms my thoughts of an black comedy picture. I would dearly love to see this with more contrast and more thought on the background - perhaps black or brick. An 8 as it is.', '2004-08-23 05:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(871310, 99078, 255, '<td valign="top">wonderfully bizarre! i wish i had a better monitor to view this on, but i can tell that this is way cool. the lighting, background, the framing/setup, the idea itself...all fantastic. surreal and nicely done.</td>', 'wonderfully bizarre! i wish i had a better monitor to view this on, but i can tell that this is way cool. the lighting, background, the framing/setup, the idea itself...all fantastic. surreal and nicely done.', '2004-08-23 05:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(871311, 99174, 21362, '<td valign="top">Just the woman critically examining her excellent figure for flaws would''ve been a powerful photo. I find the angel wings an unnecessary distraction, and not relevant to the message (as I perceive it). I love the composition of the photo. Nice lighting, with the exception of the overexposed wings. Nice entry, good luck!</td>', 'Just the woman critically examining her excellent figure for flaws would''ve been a powerful photo. I find the angel wings an unnecessary distraction, and not relevant to the message (as I perceive it). I love the composition of the photo. Nice lighting, with the exception of the overexposed wings. Nice entry, good luck!', '2004-08-23 05:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(871313, 99123, 7263, '<td valign="top">And we have a winner :D<br/> <br/>Probably the best model out of all of them which really helps. Doesn''t matter how good your photo is, if your model isn''t all that then the photo will suffer.<br/> <br/>Her pose seems very professional, as if she knows what she is doing. Her feel are nicely arched as is her back and neck. She seems to have perfect tension running through her muscles which is something a lot of shots fail to capture - resulting in lots of loose flabby skin.<br/> <br/>The lighting I am not 100% keen on, but comparatively it''s great. I can''t make my mind up if i like the highlights in the background or not.<br/> <br/>Superb capture though all round. 9</td>', 'And we have a winner :D Probably the best model out of all of them which really helps. Doesn''t matter how good your photo is, if your model isn''t all that then the photo will suffer. Her pose seems very professional, as if she knows what she is doing. Her feel are nicely arched as is her back and neck. She seems to have perfect tension running through her muscles which is something a lot of shots fail to capture - resulting in lots of loose flabby skin. The lighting I am not 100% keen on, but comparatively it''s great. I can''t make my mind up if i like the highlights in the background or not. Superb capture though all round. 9', '2004-08-23 05:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(871317, 99365, 7263, '<td valign="top">hehe, very unattractive -a good bet for brown ribbon (No pun intended of course)<br/> <br/>However, I think it''s not all that bad - it has a nice pattern to it and is fairly art abstract Esq.<br/> <br/>I would crop off the bottom 1/4 though, and lose the red bit at the bottom.<br/></td>', 'hehe, very unattractive -a good bet for brown ribbon (No pun intended of course) However, I think it''s not all that bad - it has a nice pattern to it and is fairly art abstract Esq. I would crop off the bottom 1/4 though, and lose the red bit at the bottom.', '2004-08-23 05:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(871318, 98563, 7263, '<td valign="top">I imagine a lot of people will mark you down for not being nude - but i think this is good enough at suggesting nude as it is.<br/> <br/>I think it''s too soft though, and too much attention to denim rather than that very pretty waist line. - there seems to be a lot of noise under the breasts which really isn''t god.<br/></td>', 'I imagine a lot of people will mark you down for not being nude - but i think this is good enough at suggesting nude as it is. I think it''s too soft though, and too much attention to denim rather than that very pretty waist line. - there seems to be a lot of noise under the breasts which really isn''t god.', '2004-08-23 05:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
