(871323, 98519, 7263, '<td valign="top">very hard hitting. I must say the lower portion of this image would get a 10 from me if it was the only part of the photo. Th dark tones and high contrast along with a perfect pose bode very well to me. As it is, with a bright white background it looks as if it''s floating in mid air which hinders my vote.<br/> <br/></td>', 'very hard hitting. I must say the lower portion of this image would get a 10 from me if it was the only part of the photo. Th dark tones and high contrast along with a perfect pose bode very well to me. As it is, with a bright white background it looks as if it''s floating in mid air which hinders my vote. ', '2004-08-23 05:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
