(871432, 98120, 10858, '<td valign="top">It looks more like a snapshot. You have cut her boots, background is too busy for me, and she is quite out of focus. I also find colours flat, lights are very harsh on his right leg (on the left of the photo) and she wears too many clothes to be nude... If she hadn''t been willing to take off her clothes, it would have helped to take a shot of a part of her body that''s absolutely nude, dunno. Just my opinion.</td>', 'It looks more like a snapshot. You have cut her boots, background is too busy for me, and she is quite out of focus. I also find colours flat, lights are very harsh on his right leg (on the left of the photo) and she wears too many clothes to be nude... If she hadn''t been willing to take off her clothes, it would have helped to take a shot of a part of her body that''s absolutely nude, dunno. Just my opinion.', '2004-08-23 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
