(871456, 99076, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but there are still a lot to improve. I feel like having problems with white balance, it wasn''t set up properly, also the bathroom is too busy and lighting is harsh on the tiles, her leg and his eyes are a bit out of focus for me. It''s worth to improve this idea, with soft lights, and it''s not neccessary to take the photo in the pathroom, any kind of curtain would to. If the background was a homogenic black, negative space (and a bit more space on the top) would be very expressive with the same cut.</td>', 'Nice idea, but there are still a lot to improve. I feel like having problems with white balance, it wasn''t set up properly, also the bathroom is too busy and lighting is harsh on the tiles, her leg and his eyes are a bit out of focus for me. It''s worth to improve this idea, with soft lights, and it''s not neccessary to take the photo in the pathroom, any kind of curtain would to. If the background was a homogenic black, negative space (and a bit more space on the top) would be very expressive with the same cut.', '2004-08-23 08:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
