(871613, 99123, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice print - the tonal range is excellent.  Nice lighting - great pose.  Not sure about all the negative space at the top - think you could crop about half of it - making the image even stronger.  Overall - an excellent entry.</td>', 'A very nice print - the tonal range is excellent.  Nice lighting - great pose.  Not sure about all the negative space at the top - think you could crop about half of it - making the image even stronger.  Overall - an excellent entry.', '2004-08-23 10:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(871620, 99093, 19608, '<td valign="top">Funny!!  A very creative idea - well executed.   Lighting on the face doesn''t quite seem to match the "light source"  - but it still works well.  Model did a great job. The border hurts the ikage in this case.</td>', 'Funny!!  A very creative idea - well executed.   Lighting on the face doesn''t quite seem to match the "light source"  - but it still works well.  Model did a great job. The border hurts the ikage in this case.', '2004-08-23 11:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(871623, 99407, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, great mood. Not really sure how this fits the spirit of a nude challenge for me personally... at that distance and in silhouette, it is hard to make out if he is nude, and in fact it becomes irrelevant. Great composition though, and nice graduations in tone. The figure looks oversharpened.</td>', 'Interesting shot, great mood. Not really sure how this fits the spirit of a nude challenge for me personally... at that distance and in silhouette, it is hard to make out if he is nude, and in fact it becomes irrelevant. Great composition though, and nice graduations in tone. The figure looks oversharpened.', '2004-08-23 11:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(871624, 98744, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb idea - well setup and shot.  Colors are vibrant and go so well with the black background.  Exosure handled exceptionally well.</td>', 'Superb idea - well setup and shot.  Colors are vibrant and go so well with the black background.  Exosure handled exceptionally well.', '2004-08-23 11:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(871628, 99406, 8522, '<td valign="top">A bold shot, perhaps too stark for my taste. The pose is very romantic and loving, but the light is very harsh, and the shot is not too flattering. The woman''s right shoulder is a bit tense, and looks a little like defensive body language. There''s really bad glare off the body surfaces facing the camera, so I''m presuming this was taken with flash. I think soft side-lighting would have worked much better here. The spray of water looks great, and the composition works well.</td>', 'A bold shot, perhaps too stark for my taste. The pose is very romantic and loving, but the light is very harsh, and the shot is not too flattering. The woman''s right shoulder is a bit tense, and looks a little like defensive body language. There''s really bad glare off the body surfaces facing the camera, so I''m presuming this was taken with flash. I think soft side-lighting would have worked much better here. The spray of water looks great, and the composition works well.', '2004-08-23 11:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(871629, 99257, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hmm.  Almost the same composition and model action as a recent winner.  Looks like it may also have the same slight dsaturization.  Nonethe less, it''s a great entry - gives a feeling of freedom and playfullness.</td>', 'Hmm.  Almost the same composition and model action as a recent winner.  Looks like it may also have the same slight dsaturization.  Nonethe less, it''s a great entry - gives a feeling of freedom and playfullness.', '2004-08-23 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(871630, 98975, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully posed, attractive figure, nice use of soft-focus. A little tacky and ''Athena''esque for my taste, but it certainly works.</td>', 'Wonderfully posed, attractive figure, nice use of soft-focus. A little tacky and ''Athena''esque for my taste, but it certainly works.', '2004-08-23 11:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
