(871633, 99087, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea - excellent pose.  The background is terribly distracting, as is the very shallow DoF and hash lighting.</td>', 'Great idea - excellent pose.  The background is terribly distracting, as is the very shallow DoF and hash lighting.', '2004-08-23 11:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(871634, 99247, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high-key picture. I love the pink shades used, but the border has been overdone here. A border really should not draw my attention away from it''s contents. The noise is a bit high here, I can only presume from a long exposure time. Would it have been possible to light the model better, reduce the shutter time and decrease the noise? Wonderfully posed.</td>', 'Beautiful high-key picture. I love the pink shades used, but the border has been overdone here. A border really should not draw my attention away from it''s contents. The noise is a bit high here, I can only presume from a long exposure time. Would it have been possible to light the model better, reduce the shutter time and decrease the noise? Wonderfully posed.', '2004-08-23 11:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(871635, 99247, 10080, '<td valign="top">A beautiful concept, just MUCH to washed out in my opinion</td>', 'A beautiful concept, just MUCH to washed out in my opinion', '2004-08-23 11:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
