(871661, 99337, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, a great idea. The sharpness seems way off though, particlularly on the bike, which I would expect to be pretty sharp. The composition, while okay on the bike, doesn''t really work for me on the model, as the face seems to occupy an awkward position within the frame. There are some distracting elements in the background that I would have cloned out. I''m presuming there was only one light source, as this has given everything a bit of a flat feel... another light would have been great. In all though, a very creative shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot, a great idea. The sharpness seems way off though, particlularly on the bike, which I would expect to be pretty sharp. The composition, while okay on the bike, doesn''t really work for me on the model, as the face seems to occupy an awkward position within the frame. There are some distracting elements in the background that I would have cloned out. I''m presuming there was only one light source, as this has given everything a bit of a flat feel... another light would have been great. In all though, a very creative shot.', '2004-08-23 11:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
