(871685, 98902, 8522, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, I like this a lot. I''m curious to see how this was done... off camera rear curtain flash? Double exposure? Whatever the technique, it works well. Effective high-contrast texture on wall, and the image of a man dressed only in socks with a tube map containing stops for the city works well as a piece of stock art. Good composition.</td>', 'Excellent shot, I like this a lot. I''m curious to see how this was done... off camera rear curtain flash? Double exposure? Whatever the technique, it works well. Effective high-contrast texture on wall, and the image of a man dressed only in socks with a tube map containing stops for the city works well as a piece of stock art. Good composition.', '2004-08-23 11:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
