(871712, 98928, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great response to the challenge. Love the desat and your choice of single light source from the right. Very well done.</td>', 'Great shot, great response to the challenge. Love the desat and your choice of single light source from the right. Very well done.', '2004-08-23 11:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(871713, 99287, 25143, '<td valign="top">definitely unusual</td>', 'definitely unusual', '2004-08-23 11:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(871715, 99276, 25143, '<td valign="top">amusing</td>', 'amusing', '2004-08-23 11:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(871718, 99160, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting backlighting, but doesn''t really explore the spirit of nudity for me in this challenge. Traditionally, nudes are studies in musculature and light and shadow... perhaps if you had used some poses that tightened the back muscles and gone in tighter for more of an abstract with the tiger and the back muscles this would have been a more effective nude study in my eyes. The dof is a bit too shallow here, it would have been better for everything to be in focus. Not sure about the white balance... there is too much of an orange tint to the skin tone.</td>', 'Interesting backlighting, but doesn''t really explore the spirit of nudity for me in this challenge. Traditionally, nudes are studies in musculature and light and shadow... perhaps if you had used some poses that tightened the back muscles and gone in tighter for more of an abstract with the tiger and the back muscles this would have been a more effective nude study in my eyes. The dof is a bit too shallow here, it would have been better for everything to be in focus. Not sure about the white balance... there is too much of an orange tint to the skin tone.', '2004-08-23 11:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(871723, 98928, 25143, '<td valign="top">this idea has been used so much -  and why is the foot under the buttock visible, very distracting - the loghting is very nice and so are the colours - just find a NEW theme</td>', 'this idea has been used so much -  and why is the foot under the buttock visible, very distracting - the loghting is very nice and so are the colours - just find a NEW theme', '2004-08-23 11:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(871724, 99339, 25143, '<td valign="top">definitely interesting</td>', 'definitely interesting', '2004-08-23 11:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(871725, 99123, 19978, '<td valign="top">Possibly the standout shot of the challenge. A very professional look and feel. The model''s pose is striking, as is the lighting. A thoroughly outstanding shot in every respect. My prediction is a bluey.</td>', 'Possibly the standout shot of the challenge. A very professional look and feel. The model''s pose is striking, as is the lighting. A thoroughly outstanding shot in every respect. My prediction is a bluey.', '2004-08-23 11:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(871728, 99244, 25143, '<td valign="top">very good - grain, light and all - wonderfully successful cut of the human form</td>', 'very good - grain, light and all - wonderfully successful cut of the human form', '2004-08-23 11:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(871730, 98902, 25143, '<td valign="top">very British sense of humour ! I like the colour coordination, too</td>', 'very British sense of humour ! I like the colour coordination, too', '2004-08-23 11:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(871731, 99354, 8522, '<td valign="top">A very bold shot, nicely executed. Very effective lighting and background. The man''s pose is very brave, exhibiting a vulnerability that I imagine most men would be uncomfortable with displaying in public. In this pose, the woman has taken on a mothering dynamic, and I think this shot is a very interesting exporation of the woman as sexual care-giver which is not explored very often in photography. Or maybe I''m just reading too much into this! Either way, great shot.</td>', 'A very bold shot, nicely executed. Very effective lighting and background. The man''s pose is very brave, exhibiting a vulnerability that I imagine most men would be uncomfortable with displaying in public. In this pose, the woman has taken on a mothering dynamic, and I think this shot is a very interesting exporation of the woman as sexual care-giver which is not explored very often in photography. Or maybe I''m just reading too much into this! Either way, great shot.', '2004-08-23 11:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(871732, 98960, 25143, '<td valign="top">the feet are too bright and the mood is confusing between sexy and calm; the fingers of the left hand are distracting in the armpit</td>', 'the feet are too bright and the mood is confusing between sexy and calm; the fingers of the left hand are distracting in the armpit', '2004-08-23 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(871733, 99418, 19978, '<td valign="top">Twins? Beautiful pose, very expressive faces. Love the shot.</td>', 'Twins? Beautiful pose, very expressive faces. Love the shot.', '2004-08-23 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(871735, 99160, 25143, '<td valign="top">why show the chair detail ? The fuzzy hair halo is nice.</td>', 'why show the chair detail ? The fuzzy hair halo is nice.', '2004-08-23 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(871737, 99093, 19978, '<td valign="top">The expression on his face alone is worth the shot. The composition and concept is priceless. Very nice job!</td>', 'The expression on his face alone is worth the shot. The composition and concept is priceless. Very nice job!', '2004-08-23 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(871739, 99337, 25143, '<td valign="top">finally another one with a sense of humour!! but the focus  - ?</td>', 'finally another one with a sense of humour!! but the focus  - ?', '2004-08-23 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(871740, 99174, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and pose, but I''m not sure where the angel''s wings come in?</td>', 'A beautiful model and pose, but I''m not sure where the angel''s wings come in?', '2004-08-23 11:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(871742, 99065, 25143, '<td valign="top">yoga  of course - very nice idea and lighting</td>', 'yoga  of course - very nice idea and lighting', '2004-08-23 11:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(871744, 99036, 17200, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but it''s not a typical nude :)</td>', 'I like the picture, but it''s not a typical nude :)', '2004-08-23 11:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(871745, 98372, 19978, '<td valign="top">Stunning and powerful. Everything about this image is wonderful and deeply moving. A very professional look and feel. Oh, to create photographs like this...</td>', 'Stunning and powerful. Everything about this image is wonderful and deeply moving. A very professional look and feel. Oh, to create photographs like this...', '2004-08-23 11:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(871746, 99122, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow... absolutely stunning shot. Wonderful on many levels. Great light, pose, idea, models, etc. Also emotionally compelling on many levels, a great study in sexuality. What this captures for me is the compelling need for each side of male and female to merge into the other, like a Yin/Yang. This photo is very absorbing, and is to me what art nudes should be all about. Thanks!</td>', 'Wow... absolutely stunning shot. Wonderful on many levels. Great light, pose, idea, models, etc. Also emotionally compelling on many levels, a great study in sexuality. What this captures for me is the compelling need for each side of male and female to merge into the other, like a Yin/Yang. This photo is very absorbing, and is to me what art nudes should be all about. Thanks!', '2004-08-23 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(871747, 98655, 19978, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. The timing with the olympics makes for a touch of class. Excellent entry!</td>', 'Simply beautiful. The timing with the olympics makes for a touch of class. Excellent entry!', '2004-08-23 11:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(871748, 98721, 19978, '<td valign="top">There are some very powerful and professional shots in this challenge and this is right up there with the best. Emotionally compelling and full of expression. A marvelous photograph!</td>', 'There are some very powerful and professional shots in this challenge and this is right up there with the best. Emotionally compelling and full of expression. A marvelous photograph!', '2004-08-23 11:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(871749, 98992, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love the lightness and sepia tones. The expression on her face is so mysterious and compelling. Love the pose and crop too. An all around professional portrait.</td>', 'Love the lightness and sepia tones. The expression on her face is so mysterious and compelling. Love the pose and crop too. An all around professional portrait.', '2004-08-23 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(871752, 99265, 5286, '<td valign="top">Very nice form and composition. I feel stronger lighting and contrast would have brought out the composition even more.</td>', 'Very nice form and composition. I feel stronger lighting and contrast would have brought out the composition even more.', '2004-08-23 11:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(871755, 99265, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very artistic pose makes this one work very well indeed.  I like the feeling of softness it evokes.</td>', 'A very artistic pose makes this one work very well indeed.  I like the feeling of softness it evokes.', '2004-08-23 12:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(871757, 98991, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very professional look. Love the pose and lighting. Good job.</td>', 'Very professional look. Love the pose and lighting. Good job.', '2004-08-23 12:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
