(871769, 98207, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, background is a little too distracting for me. The skin tone could have done with some NeatImage to smooth out the textures a little, the current lighting is not very flattering and highlights blotchy areas and veins. Nice composition, I particularly like the inclusion of the model''s mouth.</td>', 'Interesting shot, background is a little too distracting for me. The skin tone could have done with some NeatImage to smooth out the textures a little, the current lighting is not very flattering and highlights blotchy areas and veins. Nice composition, I particularly like the inclusion of the model''s mouth.', '2004-08-23 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(871770, 99093, 11467, '<td valign="top">LOL!!<br/>Great idea</td>', 'LOL!!Great idea', '2004-08-23 12:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(871771, 98887, 17200, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective and quite beautiful</td>', 'Simple but effective and quite beautiful', '2004-08-23 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(871772, 98655, 17200, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed and lit, great job!</td>', 'Nicely posed and lit, great job!', '2004-08-23 12:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(871773, 99055, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and elegant. The lighting makes her skin positively glow. The composition and crop are powerful. Great entry!</td>', 'Beautiful and elegant. The lighting makes her skin positively glow. The composition and crop are powerful. Great entry!', '2004-08-23 12:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(871774, 98721, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great pose - works well in the hogh-key setting.  Exposure is spot on.</td>', 'Great pose - works well in the hogh-key setting.  Exposure is spot on.', '2004-08-23 12:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(871778, 99385, 5286, '<td valign="top">So hard to find the subject in this haze of red... would probably be better off with just black and white. and maybe a cleaner bed :D</td>', 'So hard to find the subject in this haze of red... would probably be better off with just black and white. and maybe a cleaner bed :D', '2004-08-23 12:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(871780, 98519, 17200, '<td valign="top">Very well done and disturbing. I gotta give you credit for being different!</td>', 'Very well done and disturbing. I gotta give you credit for being different!', '2004-08-23 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(871781, 99228, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful, sensual look and feel. Wonderful photo.</td>', 'A beautiful, sensual look and feel. Wonderful photo.', '2004-08-23 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(871782, 99337, 19608, '<td valign="top">Funny.  You''ve handled the lighting very well.  Too bad the bike''s not a stationary model (or the back wheel could not be elevated.)  This would be better yet with the feet blurred by movement.  Nice job.</td>', 'Funny.  You''ve handled the lighting very well.  Too bad the bike''s not a stationary model (or the back wheel could not be elevated.)  This would be better yet with the feet blurred by movement.  Nice job.', '2004-08-23 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(871783, 98563, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very powerful. Great shot. I like the sepia tones. The crop is very suggestive and sensual. All around great entry.</td>', 'Very powerful. Great shot. I like the sepia tones. The crop is very suggestive and sensual. All around great entry.', '2004-08-23 12:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(871786, 98902, 19978, '<td valign="top">I hope we get to hear the story of how and when you shot this! Great composition - it looks like a lot of thought and effort went into it.</td>', 'I hope we get to hear the story of how and when you shot this! Great composition - it looks like a lot of thought and effort went into it.', '2004-08-23 12:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(871787, 99407, 16493, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, very mystic colors.</td>', 'Nice pose, very mystic colors.', '2004-08-23 12:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(871788, 99255, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure quite what your punny title means... why a play on words of defeat? Where is defeat? Without your title, I would not have been aware that this photo depicts feet, so this drawing could have been on any body part, and I think that makes this too abstract for me for a nude challenge. For me, the point of a nude study is to explore the nude form, and I''m not sure this photo does that. The skin used here is very much just a background for the Japanese looking artwork which doesn''t captivate me I''m afraid. The composition doesn''t really draw me in, and seems a bit haphazard.</td>', 'Not sure quite what your punny title means... why a play on words of defeat? Where is defeat? Without your title, I would not have been aware that this photo depicts feet, so this drawing could have been on any body part, and I think that makes this too abstract for me for a nude challenge. For me, the point of a nude study is to explore the nude form, and I''m not sure this photo does that. The skin used here is very much just a background for the Japanese looking artwork which doesn''t captivate me I''m afraid. The composition doesn''t really draw me in, and seems a bit haphazard.', '2004-08-23 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(871790, 99174, 5286, '<td valign="top">Why the wings?</td>', 'Why the wings?', '2004-08-23 12:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(871791, 98902, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea and welll handled.  I like the diagonal placement and the way you''ve manipulated the colors.</td>', 'Great idea and welll handled.  I like the diagonal placement and the way you''ve manipulated the colors.', '2004-08-23 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(871793, 99335, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I''m not sure why a naked guy is doing a handstand near a tower, but the black and white textures are great. The clouds work particularly well. A fun, quirky shot that works nicely.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I''m not sure why a naked guy is doing a handstand near a tower, but the black and white textures are great. The clouds work particularly well. A fun, quirky shot that works nicely.', '2004-08-23 12:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(871794, 98987, 5286, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and very well executed. Wonderful lighting as well.</td>', 'Great idea, and very well executed. Wonderful lighting as well.', '2004-08-23 12:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(871795, 99036, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - colors are great.  The shallow DoF makes this very hard to relate to.</td>', 'Nice idea - colors are great.  The shallow DoF makes this very hard to relate to.', '2004-08-23 12:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(871797, 98550, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, with a classic art feel to it. Only the edge of the bed dectracts badly from this shot. Her expression makes this shot work so well. Nice soft-focus effect.</td>', 'Very nice shot, with a classic art feel to it. Only the edge of the bed dectracts badly from this shot. Her expression makes this shot work so well. Nice soft-focus effect.', '2004-08-23 12:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
