(871807, 98887, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great lighting makes this really work well.  Try covering (or cropping out) the bright window - it makes the image stronger yet.  If the title would be something like "Is he home yet?"  implying that she''s peeking out in anticipation, it adds  some mystery and emotion.  Nonetheless - it''s an excellent submission.</td>', 'Great lighting makes this really work well.  Try covering (or cropping out) the bright window - it makes the image stronger yet.  If the title would be something like "Is he home yet?"  implying that she''s peeking out in anticipation, it adds  some mystery and emotion.  Nonetheless - it''s an excellent submission.', '2004-08-23 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(871812, 99118, 21606, '<td valign="top">The grain really adds texture to the image, and the hair looks like it was almost painted in. I really like this shot. It is well composed, well lit, and shot very...well. 10</td>', 'The grain really adds texture to the image, and the hair looks like it was almost painted in. I really like this shot. It is well composed, well lit, and shot very...well. 10', '2004-08-23 12:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
