(871963, 99337, 4564, '<td valign="top">I see the idea behind this photograph and I think it could have been very good.  Unfortunatly, it is clear in this case that you were limited technicaly and it affected the outcome of the image. Lighting could be greatly improved with proper equipment.  the bike could also be different; this one is rather uninteresting photography wize.  I''m sure you''ll get imamture comments about the model being overweight; personaly, I wouldn''t change her at all.  I think she''s perfect in the photo/concept.    Image is too blury (could use lots of unsharp mask in photoshop).  All in all, I really think the current photo is the shadow of a great idea you had and you were limited technically.  That''s unfortunate, but that does not mean it is not good.  ;-)  cheers! 5</td>', 'I see the idea behind this photograph and I think it could have been very good.  Unfortunatly, it is clear in this case that you were limited technicaly and it affected the outcome of the image. Lighting could be greatly improved with proper equipment.  the bike could also be different; this one is rather uninteresting photography wize.  I''m sure you''ll get imamture comments about the model being overweight; personaly, I wouldn''t change her at all.  I think she''s perfect in the photo/concept.    Image is too blury (could use lots of unsharp mask in photoshop).  All in all, I really think the current photo is the shadow of a great idea you had and you were limited technically.  That''s unfortunate, but that does not mean it is not good.  ;-)  cheers! 5', '2004-08-23 14:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
