(872253, 99244, 19978, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot. The look on her face is priceless, the detail visible in her left hand, the wedding/engagement ring, the soft focus and grain - it all makes for a package with tremendous visual appeal. An absolutely stunning submission!</td>', 'What a beautiful shot. The look on her face is priceless, the detail visible in her left hand, the wedding/engagement ring, the soft focus and grain - it all makes for a package with tremendous visual appeal. An absolutely stunning submission!', '2004-08-23 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(872255, 98550, 10268, '<td valign="top">Ahck.  I guess you can''t click add favorite and write a comment.  <br/> <br/>Which sucks since I left you a really nice comment as I was adding this photo to my favorites last night.<br/> <br/>Anyway, in short, just wanted to say that the soft focus here works pefectly,really set the mood.<br/> <br/>The model post is relaxed, and the fact she''s looking at the camera really  for some reason just adds to the beauty of her and the photo.  <br/> <br/>And lastly, this looks like a painting.  I''m not sure exactly how you got that eddect, but I really love it.  Anyway gave you a 10.</td>', 'Ahck.  I guess you can''t click add favorite and write a comment.   Which sucks since I left you a really nice comment as I was adding this photo to my favorites last night. Anyway, in short, just wanted to say that the soft focus here works pefectly,really set the mood. The model post is relaxed, and the fact she''s looking at the camera really  for some reason just adds to the beauty of her and the photo.   And lastly, this looks like a painting.  I''m not sure exactly how you got that eddect, but I really love it.  Anyway gave you a 10.', '2004-08-23 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(872257, 99252, 19978, '<td valign="top">An absolutely great entry. Your model is stunning, and I love the choice of BW and background. The soft lighting is very effective, especially on her face, where the look is positively otherworldly! The position of her left arm looks a little forced and posed (pushing the right breast a little?), but the overall impact is very powerful. Great job!!</td>', 'An absolutely great entry. Your model is stunning, and I love the choice of BW and background. The soft lighting is very effective, especially on her face, where the look is positively otherworldly! The position of her left arm looks a little forced and posed (pushing the right breast a little?), but the overall impact is very powerful. Great job!!', '2004-08-23 16:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(872258, 99401, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the hair, the wall in green!! The light, the girl..VERY good.</td>', 'I love the hair, the wall in green!! The light, the girl..VERY good.', '2004-08-23 16:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
