(872263, 98550, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this over all. I don''t like not seeing all or none of the tat. Her hair, the light and expression is awesome. Pretty work. 9</td>', 'I like this over all. I don''t like not seeing all or none of the tat. Her hair, the light and expression is awesome. Pretty work. 9', '2004-08-23 16:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(872269, 98987, 19978, '<td valign="top">I have been back to look at this photo numerous times, trying to decide exactly what to say. It''s extremely powerful and emotional. The backlighting and background is very nice, but maybe a bit overprocessed. The pose is beautiful as is the use of the cord for the five-sided star. There is just a hint of silhoutted female genitalia visible, which is a bit of a distraction (at least to my male eye). But the overall impact of this photo is significant. Very good entry.</td>', 'I have been back to look at this photo numerous times, trying to decide exactly what to say. It''s extremely powerful and emotional. The backlighting and background is very nice, but maybe a bit overprocessed. The pose is beautiful as is the use of the cord for the five-sided star. There is just a hint of silhoutted female genitalia visible, which is a bit of a distraction (at least to my male eye). But the overall impact of this photo is significant. Very good entry.', '2004-08-23 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(872270, 99118, 19978, '<td valign="top">A very powerful shot. I like your angle and crop. The details in her hair seem a bit out of focus though, which I find distracting. Her pose suggests, just suggests, and element of ecstasy or abandon, which is a very nice touch. Not overdone or lewd. Great shot!</td>', 'A very powerful shot. I like your angle and crop. The details in her hair seem a bit out of focus though, which I find distracting. Her pose suggests, just suggests, and element of ecstasy or abandon, which is a very nice touch. Not overdone or lewd. Great shot!', '2004-08-23 16:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(872274, 99415, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautifully composed and very artistic shot. I wonder if a less constrictive crop (showing just a bit more of the torso, curve of the hips, etc.) might have really made it pop. I love the fishnet look though. Very appealing visual impact.</td>', 'A beautifully composed and very artistic shot. I wonder if a less constrictive crop (showing just a bit more of the torso, curve of the hips, etc.) might have really made it pop. I love the fishnet look though. Very appealing visual impact.', '2004-08-23 16:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
