(872498, 98887, 3087, '<td valign="top">This image tells more of a story than many. Who is she looking for? Has she been sleeping alone? is she waiting for someone. Is she looking forward to their arrival or not. Or perhaps someone has just left her? The composition works well for me - I like the vertical white of the curtain against the dark vertical of the background. I like the very directional gentle diffused light. I like the texture and shapes of the crumpled sheet. A great image!</td>', 'This image tells more of a story than many. Who is she looking for? Has she been sleeping alone? is she waiting for someone. Is she looking forward to their arrival or not. Or perhaps someone has just left her? The composition works well for me - I like the vertical white of the curtain against the dark vertical of the background. I like the very directional gentle diffused light. I like the texture and shapes of the crumpled sheet. A great image!', '2004-08-23 17:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
