(872614, 99354, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have them posed and I like the sepia on the black bg.  I''m not sure about the angle you shot this at, though.  It seems like you were higher up than them and it makes them look like they are going face first, down a hill.  I also feel there''s a big too much negative space in the ULC.  I would like to see this again shot from a lower angle.  Maybe even eye level with them...?<br/> <br/>Nice work, though.  To even enter this type of contest takes guts on the part of the photographer and the victims...I mean, models. :-)</td>', 'I like the way you have them posed and I like the sepia on the black bg.  I''m not sure about the angle you shot this at, though.  It seems like you were higher up than them and it makes them look like they are going face first, down a hill.  I also feel there''s a big too much negative space in the ULC.  I would like to see this again shot from a lower angle.  Maybe even eye level with them...? Nice work, though.  To even enter this type of contest takes guts on the part of the photographer and the victims...I mean, models. :-)', '2004-08-23 18:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
