(873578, 98550, 7263, '<td valign="top">wowey, this photo is so reminiscent of a Victorian painting.<br/> <br/>Many good things here and probably the image with the most potential I have seen thus far.<br/> <br/>The soft focus is perfect - many try this but seldom get it right. The colors are to die for, muted a touch but with a vast range of differences.<br/> <br/>Facial expression is Victorian and perfect for the photo - almost innocent i feel.<br/> <br/>My gripes are with her lying on a bed - a nice chair or old settee would be more fitting I feel rather than everyday sheets. You can see all the crease etc in the sheet which takes a little away from the photo. 9<br/> <br/>Apart from that though - this is top notch!<br/></td>', 'wowey, this photo is so reminiscent of a Victorian painting. Many good things here and probably the image with the most potential I have seen thus far. The soft focus is perfect - many try this but seldom get it right. The colors are to die for, muted a touch but with a vast range of differences. Facial expression is Victorian and perfect for the photo - almost innocent i feel. My gripes are with her lying on a bed - a nice chair or old settee would be more fitting I feel rather than everyday sheets. You can see all the crease etc in the sheet which takes a little away from the photo. 9 Apart from that though - this is top notch!', '2004-08-24 06:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(873579, 99065, 7263, '<td valign="top">Man, I saw Tiger woods doing this a few months back and i try it - I can''t reach and I am only 28.<br/> <br/>The photo is well lit - perhaps a little to much warmth for my tastes. I would also like to see the light reach more, the upper arms need a bit more light on them. The pose is ok - kind of like a stretch rather than a photographic model pose.<br/> <br/>A very competent entry, but lacking any wow factor.</td>', 'Man, I saw Tiger woods doing this a few months back and i try it - I can''t reach and I am only 28. The photo is well lit - perhaps a little to much warmth for my tastes. I would also like to see the light reach more, the upper arms need a bit more light on them. The pose is ok - kind of like a stretch rather than a photographic model pose. A very competent entry, but lacking any wow factor.', '2004-08-24 06:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(873582, 98987, 7263, '<td valign="top">Now if I had to guess the photographer, I would hazard a guess that it was graphicfunk.<br/> <br/>This has a real 70''s glam rock vibe to it and I imagine to people that liked that style this would be a perfect ten.<br/> <br/>For me it''s a bit too unique for my tastes.  The model pose is well executed - everything straight and in proportion. The elastic / rope is very well executed again.<br/> <br/>the light i would like to see moved toward her front more, casting more light on her sides to give a hint f definition, as it is there isn''t enough. the background really isn''t to my tastes - but again i can give credit for it''s apparent era ;)<br/> <br/>I am very unsure about this - it really isn''t the kind of photograph i go for (although I can see it''s very well made)l, but there is something drawing me to it!!<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Now if I had to guess the photographer, I would hazard a guess that it was graphicfunk. This has a real 70''s glam rock vibe to it and I imagine to people that liked that style this would be a perfect ten. For me it''s a bit too unique for my tastes.  The model pose is well executed - everything straight and in proportion. The elastic / rope is very well executed again. the light i would like to see moved toward her front more, casting more light on her sides to give a hint f definition, as it is there isn''t enough. the background really isn''t to my tastes - but again i can give credit for it''s apparent era ;) I am very unsure about this - it really isn''t the kind of photograph i go for (although I can see it''s very well made)l, but there is something drawing me to it!! 8', '2004-08-24 06:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
