(873631, 99287, 10858, '<td valign="top">Crop is excellent! The way the background is blurred reminds me to an SLR camera, am I right? Desaturating your model gives her a statue effect, there is very little life in her. This technique can be really expressive sometimes. :-) I love the maple leaf shaped shadows on her a much.</td>', 'Crop is excellent! The way the background is blurred reminds me to an SLR camera, am I right? Desaturating your model gives her a statue effect, there is very little life in her. This technique can be really expressive sometimes. :-) I love the maple leaf shaped shadows on her a much.', '2004-08-24 07:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
