(873680, 99421, 7263, '<td valign="top">OK I see what your trying to do here, but it comes off as very tacky porn to me - sorry if that was not intended - if it was full marks :D<br/> <br/>The woman is attractive, but her pose is more slutty than arty purely because she is grasping her own breasts which i see no real need for unless it''s for the pure reason to draw attention to tits.<br/> <br/>The male seems to be there for no reasons - his grasp on her waist isn''t strong or convincing.<br/> <br/>Exposure wise it''s also a bit over done - maybe your screen is a bit too dark -I would recommend looking at the bar below every vote page and seeing if you can see the last 4 blacks on the left.<br/> <br/>If not feel free to PM me and I will explain the calibration process.<br/></td>', 'OK I see what your trying to do here, but it comes off as very tacky porn to me - sorry if that was not intended - if it was full marks :D The woman is attractive, but her pose is more slutty than arty purely because she is grasping her own breasts which i see no real need for unless it''s for the pure reason to draw attention to tits. The male seems to be there for no reasons - his grasp on her waist isn''t strong or convincing. Exposure wise it''s also a bit over done - maybe your screen is a bit too dark -I would recommend looking at the bar below every vote page and seeing if you can see the last 4 blacks on the left. If not feel free to PM me and I will explain the calibration process.', '2004-08-24 07:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(873681, 99150, 7263, '<td valign="top">yeah very unique -good thinking here. Also with the marble effect you ahve used a blue cast - probably the first person to sue a color cast to their advantage.<br/> <br/>Nice depth and composition here to - eyes go right up her legs. great stuff.</td>', 'yeah very unique -good thinking here. Also with the marble effect you ahve used a blue cast - probably the first person to sue a color cast to their advantage. Nice depth and composition here to - eyes go right up her legs. great stuff.', '2004-08-24 07:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(873682, 99415, 8522, '<td valign="top">I do like photos of nudes with that netted material, and it works very well in this shot. Some people may criticise the shallow dof, but it works for me here. Nice, sensual shot.</td>', 'I do like photos of nudes with that netted material, and it works very well in this shot. Some people may criticise the shallow dof, but it works for me here. Nice, sensual shot.', '2004-08-24 07:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(873683, 98348, 8522, '<td valign="top">I would normally not approve of babies in nude challenges, but there''s something about this shot that seems to meet the spirit of this challenge for me. I think your title has definitely helped as well. Rather than just taking a shot of a baby to meet the challenge, this is a study in the human form, using light and shadow to good effect. The expression on the baby''s face complements the shot perfectly. A sensitive and imaginative nude shot.</td>', 'I would normally not approve of babies in nude challenges, but there''s something about this shot that seems to meet the spirit of this challenge for me. I think your title has definitely helped as well. Rather than just taking a shot of a baby to meet the challenge, this is a study in the human form, using light and shadow to good effect. The expression on the baby''s face complements the shot perfectly. A sensitive and imaginative nude shot.', '2004-08-24 08:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(873684, 99252, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, the skin tones are very nice. I think the face needs some fill-in light though... the shadows make the expression look a bit severe, which is not what you want in a pregnant portrait! The door behind looks like it could do with some straightening in PS.</td>', 'Lovely shot, the skin tones are very nice. I think the face needs some fill-in light though... the shadows make the expression look a bit severe, which is not what you want in a pregnant portrait! The door behind looks like it could do with some straightening in PS.', '2004-08-24 08:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(873686, 99339, 7263, '<td valign="top">I like this Venetian blind effect - even though it''s quite popular. I think more work needs to be done on the focusing side of things though. Her hand has good definition, but her body and face seem little softer.<br/> <br/>When this blind effect works, it tends to be with more simplified poses - with a crunched up pose it can look a bit too much messy.<br/> <br/>A valiant effort.<br/></td>', 'I like this Venetian blind effect - even though it''s quite popular. I think more work needs to be done on the focusing side of things though. Her hand has good definition, but her body and face seem little softer. When this blind effect works, it tends to be with more simplified poses - with a crunched up pose it can look a bit too much messy. A valiant effort.', '2004-08-24 08:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(873687, 99174, 8522, '<td valign="top">A nice, inventive shot which has been well posed by your model. It''s ever-so-slightly overexposed for my taste, especially the burnt out highlights on her hair. Other than that, this is well lit, and I like the way the body merges with shadow in her reflection.</td>', 'A nice, inventive shot which has been well posed by your model. It''s ever-so-slightly overexposed for my taste, especially the burnt out highlights on her hair. Other than that, this is well lit, and I like the way the body merges with shadow in her reflection.', '2004-08-24 08:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(873688, 98928, 7263, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I don''t see why you have used selective desaturation here.  There is a lot of potential here with the nude and instrumnet, I think a re pose coudl be better.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I don''t see why you have used selective desaturation here.  There is a lot of potential here with the nude and instrumnet, I think a re pose coudl be better.', '2004-08-24 08:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(873689, 98991, 7263, '<td valign="top">Very nearly very good.<br/> <br/>The lighting is a bit harsh for me, and dies too quickly either side. I would like to see a more gradual fading of colors to black.<br/> <br/>The mode being littered with tattoos will make it attractive to some and not to others depending on taste, but whilst it adds interest it is more a distraction for me<br/> <br/>You have posed here well however, and the setup looks good, as is the idea.<br/> <br/>l</td>', 'Very nearly very good. The lighting is a bit harsh for me, and dies too quickly either side. I would like to see a more gradual fading of colors to black. The mode being littered with tattoos will make it attractive to some and not to others depending on taste, but whilst it adds interest it is more a distraction for me You have posed here well however, and the setup looks good, as is the idea. l', '2004-08-24 08:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(873692, 99020, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not really sure why this photo needs that title... it implies that she wasn''t at peace with her curves? Or that maybe she shouldn''t be? At any rate, this is a good portrait, the red fingernails really add to the shot. The black toussled hair works well here. Nicely composed. You do have some burnt out highlights on the skin... but rather than taking down the exposure a tad, I would have lit this more gently so the skin didn''t show veins and splotches.</td>', 'Not really sure why this photo needs that title... it implies that she wasn''t at peace with her curves? Or that maybe she shouldn''t be? At any rate, this is a good portrait, the red fingernails really add to the shot. The black toussled hair works well here. Nicely composed. You do have some burnt out highlights on the skin... but rather than taking down the exposure a tad, I would have lit this more gently so the skin didn''t show veins and splotches.', '2004-08-24 08:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(873693, 99335, 7263, '<td valign="top">great tonal range, well exposed and composed. (also a very nice straight handstand sir)<br/> <br/>My only gripe is the main focus of the photograph. I can''t see why you have included the ugly tower. Your figure takes all the attention because it''s well lit and it''s at the forefront - so the tower is a secondary thought.<br/> <br/>Without that this picture would be a 10. With much nice blank space giving the photo room to breath.<br/> <br/></td>', 'great tonal range, well exposed and composed. (also a very nice straight handstand sir) My only gripe is the main focus of the photograph. I can''t see why you have included the ugly tower. Your figure takes all the attention because it''s well lit and it''s at the forefront - so the tower is a secondary thought. Without that this picture would be a 10. With much nice blank space giving the photo room to breath. ', '2004-08-24 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(873694, 99339, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting potrait, I particularly like the hand, which works very well in the composition. I''m not really sure about the tonal range and contrast you ended up with though... I would have been tempted to increase the contrast using curves in PS. This looks a bit washed out to me, bearing in mind it''s a study in lines of shadow on a human body.</td>', 'Interesting potrait, I particularly like the hand, which works very well in the composition. I''m not really sure about the tonal range and contrast you ended up with though... I would have been tempted to increase the contrast using curves in PS. This looks a bit washed out to me, bearing in mind it''s a study in lines of shadow on a human body.', '2004-08-24 08:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(873695, 99354, 7263, '<td valign="top">I find when using a pure black background, people need to really be standing up otherwise it appears as if the subject is floating in mid-air.<br/> <br/>This is what has happened here. There is nothing to suggest any kind of flooring so it look s a bit lost just plonked in the middle.<br/> <br/>Your pose - whilst probably not for everyone, does have good qualities to is - you joined, combined and merged into one which gives me a sense of harmony.<br/> <br/>I can''t help but feel had this been shot on  a nice antique wooden floor then your score would be much higher than it is.<br/> <br/>The yellow cast isn''t needed IMHO - black and white or subdued colors would work better here for me. Choosing color casts in people is very difficult -yellow looks like jaundice - red is like scolding - blue is like dead people - green is like illness. etc etc<br/> <br/>Full marks for the other qualities  though.</td>', 'I find when using a pure black background, people need to really be standing up otherwise it appears as if the subject is floating in mid-air. This is what has happened here. There is nothing to suggest any kind of flooring so it look s a bit lost just plonked in the middle. Your pose - whilst probably not for everyone, does have good qualities to is - you joined, combined and merged into one which gives me a sense of harmony. I can''t help but feel had this been shot on  a nice antique wooden floor then your score would be much higher than it is. The yellow cast isn''t needed IMHO - black and white or subdued colors would work better here for me. Choosing color casts in people is very difficult -yellow looks like jaundice - red is like scolding - blue is like dead people - green is like illness. etc etc Full marks for the other qualities  though.', '2004-08-24 08:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(873696, 99160, 7263, '<td valign="top">nice frontal lighting but looks a little static - as if he is sitting on a  chair doing nothing.<br/> <br/>Also needs a bit more focus on the tat if your trying to point that out as a focal point.<br/></td>', 'nice frontal lighting but looks a little static - as if he is sitting on a  chair doing nothing. Also needs a bit more focus on the tat if your trying to point that out as a focal point.', '2004-08-24 08:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(873697, 98590, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot looks too much like a cheeky snapshot which has been converted into b&amp;w for more of an ''arty'' feel. There''s too much glare on the background water, which distracts from the model... you could have removed this with a polariser. Not really sure what you were trying to achieve with this shot.</td>', 'This shot looks too much like a cheeky snapshot which has been converted into b&w for more of an ''arty'' feel. There''s too much glare on the background water, which distracts from the model... you could have removed this with a polariser. Not really sure what you were trying to achieve with this shot.', '2004-08-24 08:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(873700, 99406, 7263, '<td valign="top">I am guessing this is bobsters pic - if so I am not going to comment ;D<br/> <br/>Joke.<br/> <br/>Right, lots to say here. I think for starters your pose is nice and loving. There is a good degree of united front and togetherness here, and you have captured a tender moment.<br/> <br/>However, for these positives, i can see some people using that as a negative. Humans by nature do not like to see others being affectionate (well the British don''t ;) So people may feel uncomfortable seeing an image posed as this one is. Joining that with the fact that we all kind of know each other on DPC makes it more personal and accentuates that even more so.<br/> <br/>That aside, i think it could do with a smidgen of contrast - making some deeper dark shadows or blacks really come out and give it more contrast.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I am guessing this is bobsters pic - if so I am not going to comment ;D Joke. Right, lots to say here. I think for starters your pose is nice and loving. There is a good degree of united front and togetherness here, and you have captured a tender moment. However, for these positives, i can see some people using that as a negative. Humans by nature do not like to see others being affectionate (well the British don''t ;) So people may feel uncomfortable seeing an image posed as this one is. Joining that with the fact that we all kind of know each other on DPC makes it more personal and accentuates that even more so. That aside, i think it could do with a smidgen of contrast - making some deeper dark shadows or blacks really come out and give it more contrast. ', '2004-08-24 08:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(873701, 98744, 7263, '<td valign="top">nice idea, central and eye catching - the box looks a bit messy and the pose is ever so slightly lopsided. Sounds picky but lopsidedness really affects some images.<br/> <br/>Overall a very nice and new effort! Good luck!</td>', 'nice idea, central and eye catching - the box looks a bit messy and the pose is ever so slightly lopsided. Sounds picky but lopsidedness really affects some images. Overall a very nice and new effort! Good luck!', '2004-08-24 08:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(873702, 99122, 7263, '<td valign="top">As a fan of huge contrast i must say this i a little to dark and dirty for me. The skin tones are grainy and brown which tends to look more like dirt than dark.<br/> <br/>I think with a black background this would be more fitting and make the darkness less harsh.<br/> <br/>Nice pose though - would like to see it centered.</td>', 'As a fan of huge contrast i must say this i a little to dark and dirty for me. The skin tones are grainy and brown which tends to look more like dirt than dark. I think with a black background this would be more fitting and make the darkness less harsh. Nice pose though - would like to see it centered.', '2004-08-24 08:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(873703, 99257, 7263, '<td valign="top">hehe a common shot -but a good''en!!!! Great tension and moment of capture on the figure.  Can''t fault this in many ways. A little bit dull as far as definition and light go - but nothing too much that takes away from the moment.<br/> <br/>Top ten for sure.<br/></td>', 'hehe a common shot -but a good''en!!!! Great tension and moment of capture on the figure.  Can''t fault this in many ways. A little bit dull as far as definition and light go - but nothing too much that takes away from the moment. Top ten for sure.', '2004-08-24 08:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(873705, 98648, 7263, '<td valign="top">Now as far as sweetness goes, this is a ten. For photographic qualities is isn''t so high I am afraid. The white fade is very cheap looking and ruins this shot.</td>', 'Now as far as sweetness goes, this is a ten. For photographic qualities is isn''t so high I am afraid. The white fade is very cheap looking and ruins this shot.', '2004-08-24 08:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(873708, 99276, 7263, '<td valign="top">Yup very cool and very different - one of my picks. Maybe a little more contrast needed.?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yup very cool and very different - one of my picks. Maybe a little more contrast needed.? ', '2004-08-24 08:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(873709, 99190, 7263, '<td valign="top">Yeah! i like this huge amounts. Great effective use of grain - sublime coloring and so unobtrusive and gentle! <br/> <br/>Here, have  big fat 10 ;D</td>', 'Yeah! i like this huge amounts. Great effective use of grain - sublime coloring and so unobtrusive and gentle!  Here, have  big fat 10 ;D', '2004-08-24 08:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(873710, 99232, 7263, '<td valign="top">nice angle, good twist for interest. Nice pose from the male model - a very masculine pose. Colors seem a bit too vibrant - and the range of reds to blues is too drastic. I suggest toning the saturation down by 10-30%.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice shot.<br/></td>', 'nice angle, good twist for interest. Nice pose from the male model - a very masculine pose. Colors seem a bit too vibrant - and the range of reds to blues is too drastic. I suggest toning the saturation down by 10-30%. Overall a nice shot.', '2004-08-24 08:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(873711, 99407, 7263, '<td valign="top">The scale seems way off on this photo - like that man is either standing on  a mole hill or is the biggest dude in history ;D<br/> <br/>Apart from that I like the colors and the atmospherics. Maybe a bit too much blue at the bottom - and a bit more detail needed.<br/> <br/>Overall a top ten pic.<br/></td>', 'The scale seems way off on this photo - like that man is either standing on  a mole hill or is the biggest dude in history ;D Apart from that I like the colors and the atmospherics. Maybe a bit too much blue at the bottom - and a bit more detail needed. Overall a top ten pic.', '2004-08-24 08:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(873714, 99414, 7263, '<td valign="top">very cute - like the subdued coloring and skin tones are spot on. Would be nice to have both babies facing camera or at least both with eye contact - kind of a requisite for decent portraitures.<br/> <br/>Also perhaps a bit more focus or even unsharp mask if to late.<br/> <br/>Great effort though - a top ten pick</td>', 'very cute - like the subdued coloring and skin tones are spot on. Would be nice to have both babies facing camera or at least both with eye contact - kind of a requisite for decent portraitures. Also perhaps a bit more focus or even unsharp mask if to late. Great effort though - a top ten pick', '2004-08-24 08:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(873715, 98972, 7263, '<td valign="top">why is this red? A little too much black at the bottom and not enough contrast to get a feel of the human form.<br/></td>', 'why is this red? A little too much black at the bottom and not enough contrast to get a feel of the human form.', '2004-08-24 08:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(873717, 99123, 13365, '<td valign="top">Great pose, Great lighting!</td>', 'Great pose, Great lighting!', '2004-08-24 08:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(873718, 99420, 7263, '<td valign="top">man I hate to see good shots go to waste due to selective saturation. I can''t see why people us it - but many do and many like it so i guess I am the odd one out.<br/> <br/>A nice shot with a tender if not almost to tender moment.<br/> <br/>A little bit too much personal for my taste on a family site ;D But it does it''s job of being erotic yet tasteful.<br/> <br/>A valiant effort - i guess just outsdie the top 10 - say 12th?<br/></td>', 'man I hate to see good shots go to waste due to selective saturation. I can''t see why people us it - but many do and many like it so i guess I am the odd one out. A nice shot with a tender if not almost to tender moment. A little bit too much personal for my taste on a family site ;D But it does it''s job of being erotic yet tasteful. A valiant effort - i guess just outsdie the top 10 - say 12th?', '2004-08-24 08:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(873720, 99094, 7263, '<td valign="top">fantastic angle to shoot from -full marks to you. The image needs a bit more work on the light and tones, but don''t let that take away from a very nice shot.</td>', 'fantastic angle to shoot from -full marks to you. The image needs a bit more work on the light and tones, but don''t let that take away from a very nice shot.', '2004-08-24 08:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
