(873723, 99087, 7263, '<td valign="top">heheh, well posed. I am sure your not expecting this to do well -but it does have it''s qualities. i won''t bother to say i think the exposure is a little to blown out. ;D</td>', 'heheh, well posed. I am sure your not expecting this to do well -but it does have it''s qualities. i won''t bother to say i think the exposure is a little to blown out. ;D', '2004-08-24 08:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
