(873841, 98895, 20407, '<td valign="top">The ladybug is intruiging - I''m not sure why it''s there. The lighting is nice. I think it could be more dynamic with a tighter crop.</td>', 'The ladybug is intruiging - I''m not sure why it''s there. The lighting is nice. I think it could be more dynamic with a tighter crop.', '2004-08-24 10:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
