(873850, 99418, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is cute. I''m interested in seeing how this was done. I wasn''t planning to comment on the models, but I have to say that I love her tatts- the colours are fantastic :)</td>', 'This is cute. I''m interested in seeing how this was done. I wasn''t planning to comment on the models, but I have to say that I love her tatts- the colours are fantastic :)', '2004-08-24 10:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(873853, 99414, 25388, '<td valign="top">great expressions captured here</td>', 'great expressions captured here', '2004-08-24 10:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(873856, 99174, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great image, my only complaint would be that it appears to be slightly overdone in something like neatimage. Just seem to loose a little defintion in the hair.... it looks a little smudged or something.... also it''s a little blown out in the hair and the wings in the foreground image, other than that it is certainly a great image. Well done!<br/>Good Luck, Todd.</td>', 'Great image, my only complaint would be that it appears to be slightly overdone in something like neatimage. Just seem to loose a little defintion in the hair.... it looks a little smudged or something.... also it''s a little blown out in the hair and the wings in the foreground image, other than that it is certainly a great image. Well done!Good Luck, Todd.', '2004-08-24 10:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
