(873876, 99244, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the choice of high grain black and white. Nice pose, nice crop.</td>', 'Love the choice of high grain black and white. Nice pose, nice crop.', '2004-08-24 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(873878, 98291, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the chiffon prop, it''s nice to some flesh directly and some through the haze of the chiffon.</td>', 'I like the use of the chiffon prop, it''s nice to some flesh directly and some through the haze of the chiffon.', '2004-08-24 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(873880, 98372, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is lit to allow the body to merge into the black background. Excellent use of negative space to emphasise loneliness and desolation.</td>', 'I like the way this is lit to allow the body to merge into the black background. Excellent use of negative space to emphasise loneliness and desolation.', '2004-08-24 11:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(873882, 98120, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and a lovely shot, but doesn''t meet the challenge, IMO.</td>', 'A beautiful model and a lovely shot, but doesn''t meet the challenge, IMO.', '2004-08-24 11:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(873883, 99354, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I like the warm skin tones against the black background and the shapes of the tangled bodies. The viewpoint seems very strange to me, is it taken from directly above?</td>', 'This is beautiful. I like the warm skin tones against the black background and the shapes of the tangled bodies. The viewpoint seems very strange to me, is it taken from directly above?', '2004-08-24 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(873887, 99257, 3087, '<td valign="top">This reminds me strongly of Heida''s recent Free Spirit entry, an image I like very much. I think this would benefit from the inclusion of just a touch of the sand shore, as that one does. I like the fact that the horizon is high within the frame and that the clouds add interest to the sky.</td>', 'This reminds me strongly of Heida''s recent Free Spirit entry, an image I like very much. I think this would benefit from the inclusion of just a touch of the sand shore, as that one does. I like the fact that the horizon is high within the frame and that the clouds add interest to the sky.', '2004-08-24 11:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(873888, 99174, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting image and nicely done in terms of lighting, composition and colour tones.</td>', 'An interesting image and nicely done in terms of lighting, composition and colour tones.', '2004-08-24 11:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(873889, 99287, 19978, '<td valign="top">Wow, this almost looks like a stone statue, but I think it''s a heavily processed female human. Very artistic take on the challenge. I like the desat and applied grain. The pose is very dramatic and emotionally charged and I love the use of foliage, both over the privates as well as in the soft background. This image didn''t "strike" me on my first review, but it certainly rewards closer study. Very, very well done!</td>', 'Wow, this almost looks like a stone statue, but I think it''s a heavily processed female human. Very artistic take on the challenge. I like the desat and applied grain. The pose is very dramatic and emotionally charged and I love the use of foliage, both over the privates as well as in the soft background. This image didn''t "strike" me on my first review, but it certainly rewards closer study. Very, very well done!', '2004-08-24 11:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(873890, 98850, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I love the unusual pattern of the light on the wall. His crouched pose is intriguing. I like that he isn''t looking directly at the camera, it makes it feel like he doesn''t know "we" are there. Good choice of black and white too.</td>', 'This is a great image. I love the unusual pattern of the light on the wall. His crouched pose is intriguing. I like that he isn''t looking directly at the camera, it makes it feel like he doesn''t know "we" are there. Good choice of black and white too.', '2004-08-24 11:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(873898, 99065, 19978, '<td valign="top">Absolutely outstanding! The pose and crop are very effective, as is the black background. I wish the top were a little more exposed so I could make out at least the outlines of the head. Since the hands are the subject, I''d like to see them a little more clearly also. Great job though!</td>', 'Absolutely outstanding! The pose and crop are very effective, as is the black background. I wish the top were a little more exposed so I could make out at least the outlines of the head. Since the hands are the subject, I''d like to see them a little more clearly also. Great job though!', '2004-08-24 11:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(873911, 98348, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Love the composition!  10+</td>', 'Very cute!  Love the composition!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(873912, 99119, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting snapshot... can''t find much more value than that though...</td>', 'Interesting snapshot... can''t find much more value than that though...', '2004-08-24 11:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(873913, 99337, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I think the wheels cropped at this point seem a bit awkward, and the focus overall seems a bit soft too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-30 08:25:58.</i></td>', 'Nice shot, but I think the wheels cropped at this point seem a bit awkward, and the focus overall seems a bit soft too.', '2004-08-24 11:22:08.000000', '2004-08-30 09:25:58.000000', 1),
(873914, 99413, 772, '<td valign="top">The light here is not very flattering.  Flash is rarely a good sole source of light for this type of photo...</td>', 'The light here is not very flattering.  Flash is rarely a good sole source of light for this type of photo...', '2004-08-24 11:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(873916, 99415, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very creative, terrific lighting &amp; composition!  10+</td>', 'Very creative, terrific lighting & composition!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(873917, 99365, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry.</td>', 'Nice symmetry.', '2004-08-24 11:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(873920, 99287, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very artisically composed.  Great lighting resources.  10+</td>', 'Very artisically composed.  Great lighting resources.  10+', '2004-08-24 11:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(873922, 99365, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this photo may suffer from ''color'' moreso than anything else.  It appears that you may have two different colored light sources which aren''t meshing well.  Solution: black and white.  The symmetry in this photo is also not particularly appealing to me.  Maybe a little rotation of the camera to create some diagonals would be an improvement as well...</td>', 'I think this photo may suffer from ''color'' moreso than anything else.  It appears that you may have two different colored light sources which aren''t meshing well.  Solution: black and white.  The symmetry in this photo is also not particularly appealing to me.  Maybe a little rotation of the camera to create some diagonals would be an improvement as well...', '2004-08-24 11:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(873923, 99123, 10673, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, although I think the lighting could have been just a little bit more focused on the subject.  Overall a good shot, though.  8</td>', 'Love the composition, although I think the lighting could have been just a little bit more focused on the subject.  Overall a good shot, though.  8', '2004-08-24 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(873924, 99257, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice title, hehe :)</td>', 'Nice title, hehe :)', '2004-08-24 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(873926, 98550, 10673, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition, excellent lighting &amp; tones.  10+</td>', 'Terrific composition, excellent lighting & tones.  10+', '2004-08-24 11:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(873929, 99244, 10673, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed &amp; executed.  Love the soft focus effects!  10+</td>', 'Beautifully composed & executed.  Love the soft focus effects!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(873933, 99257, 10673, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed &amp; executed!  Splendid work!  10+</td>', 'Beautifully composed & executed!  Splendid work!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(873934, 99401, 3697, '<td valign="top">This has got to be a Dr. Jones original! The lighting and color are both fantastic, and the model.... WOW! She''s gorgeous. Very nice work.</td>', 'This has got to be a Dr. Jones original! The lighting and color are both fantastic, and the model.... WOW! She''s gorgeous. Very nice work.', '2004-08-24 11:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(873937, 99252, 10673, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  10+</td>', 'Beautifully done!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(873941, 98325, 10673, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition...nice tight framing!  10+</td>', 'Terrific composition...nice tight framing!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(873944, 98291, 10673, '<td valign="top">Elegant with a flair...nicely done!  10+</td>', 'Elegant with a flair...nicely done!  10+', '2004-08-24 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(873978, 98408, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this is a self-portrait, so well done for giving it a go. However, I think the end result here is a bit too snapshot for my taste. The inclusion of all of the headboard and a good amount of the bed gives a bit too much of a ''mundane'' feel, and the composition of the bed in the shot feels a bit unimaginative. You exploit the top-left to bottom-right diagonal well, and with a stronger background and better lighting, this would have been a good part of the composition. The light looks like daylight through a single window, and I don''t think that works too well here. I would have tried this shot with some lamps at night with some long exposures to play with the resulting shadows.</td>', 'I''m assuming this is a self-portrait, so well done for giving it a go. However, I think the end result here is a bit too snapshot for my taste. The inclusion of all of the headboard and a good amount of the bed gives a bit too much of a ''mundane'' feel, and the composition of the bed in the shot feels a bit unimaginative. You exploit the top-left to bottom-right diagonal well, and with a stronger background and better lighting, this would have been a good part of the composition. The light looks like daylight through a single window, and I don''t think that works too well here. I would have tried this shot with some lamps at night with some long exposures to play with the resulting shadows.', '2004-08-24 12:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(873980, 98372, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good use of light and shadow. I''m not sure about your composition... I think I would have used more negative space to communicate your subject''s sense of isolation. I''d have liked a bit more sharpness.</td>', 'Nice shot, good use of light and shadow. I''m not sure about your composition... I think I would have used more negative space to communicate your subject''s sense of isolation. I''d have liked a bit more sharpness.', '2004-08-24 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(873983, 99119, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too much like a snapshot for my taste, and onboard flash is usually not a great source of light. You could have removed the red eyes caused by the flash in PS. The background isn''t too great... try to prevent objects such as trees growing from your subjects!</td>', 'Looks a bit too much like a snapshot for my taste, and onboard flash is usually not a great source of light. You could have removed the red eyes caused by the flash in PS. The background isn''t too great... try to prevent objects such as trees growing from your subjects!', '2004-08-24 12:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(873985, 98887, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with a great mood. Your model has a great figure, and looks comfortable in front of the camera. Great exploration of light and shadow, I love how the light plays with the crumpled sheets.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with a great mood. Your model has a great figure, and looks comfortable in front of the camera. Great exploration of light and shadow, I love how the light plays with the crumpled sheets.', '2004-08-24 12:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(873986, 99036, 8522, '<td valign="top">Clearly does not meet the challenge, and is not an appetising shot of food.</td>', 'Clearly does not meet the challenge, and is not an appetising shot of food.', '2004-08-24 12:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(873988, 99335, 23912, '<td valign="top">This is very artistically done. The b/w image makes it all the more effective. I also like that you can''t tell if it is a man or a woman lending to the effect of great artistry.</td>', 'This is very artistically done. The b/w image makes it all the more effective. I also like that you can''t tell if it is a man or a woman lending to the effect of great artistry.', '2004-08-24 12:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(873992, 99361, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great cheeky shot, which draws the viewer in by curiosity. What is not shown here is more important that what we are allowed to see. Shame about the blown highlights on the shirt.</td>', 'Great cheeky shot, which draws the viewer in by curiosity. What is not shown here is more important that what we are allowed to see. Shame about the blown highlights on the shirt.', '2004-08-24 12:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(873994, 98721, 23912, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, artistic and extremely tasteful. This conjures a moment of meditation in my minds eye.</td>', 'Beautiful, artistic and extremely tasteful. This conjures a moment of meditation in my minds eye.', '2004-08-24 12:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(874000, 99247, 23912, '<td valign="top">This is how pregnancy should be perceived, beauty in the palm of your hands! Captivating image!</td>', 'This is how pregnancy should be perceived, beauty in the palm of your hands! Captivating image!', '2004-08-24 12:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(874002, 98992, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good high-key shot. I would have tried to use glasses which were less powerful... glasses which cure short-sightedness have the unfortunate effect of making the wearer''s eyes appear smaller and I think the most important element of most portraits are the eyes which is where most viewers will focus first. The strategic placement of the braids is a nice touch and works well here. It can look corny, but not here. Unusual composition which works well, but I''m not fond of your border effect. Just the fact that the top of her head is missing is enough to make her ''pop'' out at you.</td>', 'Good high-key shot. I would have tried to use glasses which were less powerful... glasses which cure short-sightedness have the unfortunate effect of making the wearer''s eyes appear smaller and I think the most important element of most portraits are the eyes which is where most viewers will focus first. The strategic placement of the braids is a nice touch and works well here. It can look corny, but not here. Unusual composition which works well, but I''m not fond of your border effect. Just the fact that the top of her head is missing is enough to make her ''pop'' out at you.', '2004-08-24 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(874004, 98987, 23912, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I feel this image would''ve been so much more perfect had this been a man. This is one of my favorite images out of all the shots I''ve seen.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I feel this image would''ve been so much more perfect had this been a man. This is one of my favorite images out of all the shots I''ve seen.', '2004-08-24 12:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(874006, 98928, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, and one of my favourites this challenge. My wife plays the cello, so I have a particular affinity for this one. Nice idea to selectively desaturate, and the result works well if a little unflattering to her skin tone. Her pose is relaxed and her body shape and size complements the cello perfectly. Great lighting, and good composition.</td>', 'Very nice photo, and one of my favourites this challenge. My wife plays the cello, so I have a particular affinity for this one. Nice idea to selectively desaturate, and the result works well if a little unflattering to her skin tone. Her pose is relaxed and her body shape and size complements the cello perfectly. Great lighting, and good composition.', '2004-08-24 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(874007, 99055, 21669, '<td valign="top">Capture the essence and sensuality of nudity with out being in the least bit smutty - a very tastefull shot.</td>', 'Capture the essence and sensuality of nudity with out being in the least bit smutty - a very tastefull shot.', '2004-08-24 12:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(874008, 99223, 23912, '<td valign="top">In my honest opinion I don''t think this was tastefully done as the rules ask. The lighting  is well placed, lending to the title of the pic,though.</td>', 'In my honest opinion I don''t think this was tastefully done as the rules ask. The lighting  is well placed, lending to the title of the pic,though.', '2004-08-24 12:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(874011, 99407, 23912, '<td valign="top">Perfect! This is the winner in my eyes. It is tastefully done and the lighting is portraying a man on a quest, everything a nude challenge should be! Well done!</td>', 'Perfect! This is the winner in my eyes. It is tastefully done and the lighting is portraying a man on a quest, everything a nude challenge should be! Well done!', '2004-08-24 12:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(874012, 99414, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 5<br/>Subject Appeal: 5<br/>Compositional Appeal: 3<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 4<br/>Creativity: 4<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 3<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This is certainly a cute photo. As an outsider, this photo doesn''t hold much appeal to ''me''.  This is a relatively common type of family photo and it doesn''t hold any specific qualities that would draw me in as an outsider.   <br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 5Subject Appeal: 5Compositional Appeal: 3Effective use of color/bw: 4Creativity: 4Theme/Storytelling qualities: 3 Additional Comments: This is certainly a cute photo. As an outsider, this photo doesn''t hold much appeal to ''me''.  This is a relatively common type of family photo and it doesn''t hold any specific qualities that would draw me in as an outsider.   ', '2004-08-24 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(874014, 99265, 23912, '<td valign="top">Artistically perfect! I like the b/w image, it lends to the silence of the moment. Well done!</td>', 'Artistically perfect! I like the b/w image, it lends to the silence of the moment. Well done!', '2004-08-24 12:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(874016, 99117, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 5<br/>Subject Appeal: 5<br/>Compositional Appeal: 5<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 7<br/>Creativity: 8<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 7<br/>Title: 2<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This is a neat photo and I think your choices for lighting work relatively well.  You have done an excellent job of creating ''nudity'' where there is none.  This type of creativity is to be commended :)<br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 5Subject Appeal: 5Compositional Appeal: 5Effective use of color/bw: 7Creativity: 8Theme/Storytelling qualities: 7Title: 2 Additional Comments: This is a neat photo and I think your choices for lighting work relatively well.  You have done an excellent job of creating ''nudity'' where there is none.  This type of creativity is to be commended :)', '2004-08-24 12:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(874021, 98120, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 4<br/>Subject Appeal: 5<br/>Compositional Appeal: 3<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 3<br/>Creativity: 3<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 5<br/>Title: 5<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>I don''t really understand your intent with this photo.  Your model is certainly beautiful.  The environment in which you chose to photograph her is not particularly appealing, and the spotty sunlight is quite harsh.  <br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 4Subject Appeal: 5Compositional Appeal: 3Effective use of color/bw: 3Creativity: 3Theme/Storytelling qualities: 5Title: 5 Additional Comments: I don''t really understand your intent with this photo.  Your model is certainly beautiful.  The environment in which you chose to photograph her is not particularly appealing, and the spotty sunlight is quite harsh.  ', '2004-08-24 12:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(874028, 98902, 18197, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful whimsical photo. I am sure I have stood exactly where you stood and looked at exactly that underground sign. But never with your model present. Great photo. Great idea. great execution. Among my top picks.</td>', 'What a wonderful whimsical photo. I am sure I have stood exactly where you stood and looked at exactly that underground sign. But never with your model present. Great photo. Great idea. great execution. Among my top picks.', '2004-08-24 12:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(874029, 98744, 21606, '<td valign="top">I really love this art! She looks like a beautiful glowing statue. Wonderful lighting, composition, and contrast. A perfect 10.</td>', 'I really love this art! She looks like a beautiful glowing statue. Wonderful lighting, composition, and contrast. A perfect 10.', '2004-08-24 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(874030, 98325, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 3<br/>Subject Appeal: 4<br/>Compositional Appeal: 3<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 4<br/>Creativity: 5<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 5<br/>Title: 6<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This composition and subject lends itself nicely to b/w.  I believe that a little more contrast could be nice also.  I also can''t determine why you chose not to put this image in sharp focus... maybe its a little motion blur, but a soft focus, even if intended, would contradict your title to some extent.  <br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 3Subject Appeal: 4Compositional Appeal: 3Effective use of color/bw: 4Creativity: 5Theme/Storytelling qualities: 5Title: 6 Additional Comments: This composition and subject lends itself nicely to b/w.  I believe that a little more contrast could be nice also.  I also can''t determine why you chose not to put this image in sharp focus... maybe its a little motion blur, but a soft focus, even if intended, would contradict your title to some extent.  ', '2004-08-24 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(874031, 98850, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo. The desaturation adds intense emotional impact. Composition is perfect. Focus and DOF are perfect. Lighting is very vry good. (10)</td>', 'This is an excellent photo. The desaturation adds intense emotional impact. Composition is perfect. Focus and DOF are perfect. Lighting is very vry good. (10)', '2004-08-24 12:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(874034, 98744, 18197, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Well posed. Well captured and edited. Great job. Among my top picks.</td>', 'Clever idea. Well posed. Well captured and edited. Great job. Among my top picks.', '2004-08-24 12:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
