(874045, 98987, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Firstly it was a cleaver idea. The editing really adds to the artistic feel of the photo. I am sure you will draw fire from many who will complain about photography vs digital art. Don''t let it bog you down. I like this and it''s among my top picks.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Firstly it was a cleaver idea. The editing really adds to the artistic feel of the photo. I am sure you will draw fire from many who will complain about photography vs digital art. Don''t let it bog you down. I like this and it''s among my top picks.', '2004-08-24 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
