(874103, 98991, 17200, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting, but the picture is pretty good overall</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting, but the picture is pretty good overall', '2004-08-24 13:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(874114, 99087, 7152, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot .. its a clever alternative to people. I also like the blurring effect you are using.  The only thing I would change about this photo to make it perfect is the background .. I find that it is a little distracting (the curves in it) .. the light is also a bit too bright, but overall I really like this picture</td>', 'I really like this shot .. its a clever alternative to people. I also like the blurring effect you are using.  The only thing I would change about this photo to make it perfect is the background .. I find that it is a little distracting (the curves in it) .. the light is also a bit too bright, but overall I really like this picture', '2004-08-24 13:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(874115, 99123, 7152, '<td valign="top">Wow .. I dont think there is anything you cuold improve in this .. the tones are perfect, lighting is perfect, the pose of the model .. if I could give this more than 10 I would.</td>', 'Wow .. I dont think there is anything you cuold improve in this .. the tones are perfect, lighting is perfect, the pose of the model .. if I could give this more than 10 I would.', '2004-08-24 13:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(874117, 98992, 7152, '<td valign="top">wow .. very nice .. the colors are great here .. I like how the model is almost fading into the background .. but her hair stands out ... I really like this effect .. 10/10</td>', 'wow .. very nice .. the colors are great here .. I like how the model is almost fading into the background .. but her hair stands out ... I really like this effect .. 10/10', '2004-08-24 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(874120, 99240, 7152, '<td valign="top">this is a stunning shot .. the black and white is perfect here, same with the lighting and composition ... after looking at the photo for a while I''ve begun to notice that the way the man holding is holding the girl seems un-natural  .. I get this feeling when I look at his shoulders .. it almost seems like he has them higher up than he normally would (in order to cover the girl I guess). Regardless I still think this deserves over 10.</td>', 'this is a stunning shot .. the black and white is perfect here, same with the lighting and composition ... after looking at the photo for a while I''ve begun to notice that the way the man holding is holding the girl seems un-natural  .. I get this feeling when I look at his shoulders .. it almost seems like he has them higher up than he normally would (in order to cover the girl I guess). Regardless I still think this deserves over 10.', '2004-08-24 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(874122, 99228, 7152, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photographs that I cannot think of chaning anything .. its all perfect .. I can only say congrats to you and your model for such a wonderful shot. I hope this places well.</td>', 'This is one of those photographs that I cannot think of chaning anything .. its all perfect .. I can only say congrats to you and your model for such a wonderful shot. I hope this places well.', '2004-08-24 13:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(874123, 99420, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the black and white with the red, nicely done.</td>', 'I like the use of the black and white with the red, nicely done.', '2004-08-24 13:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(874131, 99093, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL...very funny!!</td>', 'LOL...very funny!!', '2004-08-24 13:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(874143, 99123, 14133, '<td valign="top">Nice light, good composed, only which I dont like is this back hand which destroid the body line and looks deformed. But good work!</td>', 'Nice light, good composed, only which I dont like is this back hand which destroid the body line and looks deformed. But good work!', '2004-08-24 13:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(874153, 99337, 10858, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but selective desaturation doesn''t really work here. There are some brown and blue areas and a lot of B&amp;W. When using this technique, always think about: What do I want to tell people with leaving some parts colourized, some parts B&amp;W? Is there any additional message of this technique? Here it rather spoiled your photo... though, it would be nice if it was a bit sharper and completely black and white. I would also improve lighting a bit, it''s too straight for me... or is it symbolising that she sees the light in at the end of the tunnel? :-)</td>', 'The idea is good, but selective desaturation doesn''t really work here. There are some brown and blue areas and a lot of B&W. When using this technique, always think about: What do I want to tell people with leaving some parts colourized, some parts B&W? Is there any additional message of this technique? Here it rather spoiled your photo... though, it would be nice if it was a bit sharper and completely black and white. I would also improve lighting a bit, it''s too straight for me... or is it symbolising that she sees the light in at the end of the tunnel? :-)', '2004-08-24 13:37:01.000000', NULL, 1);
