(874165, 99407, 10858, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me to heida''s style, sorry If I am mistaken. The shades of blue are wonderful, the silhouette is expressive. I might have cropped a little-little bit on the bottom, but alltogether a wonderful, simple shot!</td>', 'This photo reminds me to heida''s style, sorry If I am mistaken. The shades of blue are wonderful, the silhouette is expressive. I might have cropped a little-little bit on the bottom, but alltogether a wonderful, simple shot!', '2004-08-24 13:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
