(874334, 99240, 7485, '<td valign="top">Love the freckles! Only wish his eye had a catch-light reflection like her''s, or we could see more of his face. Also, I think cropping just above her navel would simplify the image. But all in all an excellent pose, composition, and lighting - 8</td>', 'Love the freckles! Only wish his eye had a catch-light reflection like her''s, or we could see more of his face. Also, I think cropping just above her navel would simplify the image. But all in all an excellent pose, composition, and lighting - 8', '2004-08-24 15:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(874336, 98408, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good pose, but maybe better in B&amp;W? As is, there are too many clashing tan/brown/orange shades.</td>', 'Good pose, but maybe better in B&W? As is, there are too many clashing tan/brown/orange shades.', '2004-08-24 15:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(874355, 99259, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think this is a cool composition, but I would not have included the face of the one manniquin, as well, the whole image seems soft without purpose. Otherwise, very cool shot. :)</td>', 'i think this is a cool composition, but I would not have included the face of the one manniquin, as well, the whole image seems soft without purpose. Otherwise, very cool shot. :)', '2004-08-24 15:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
