(874395, 99401, 7711, '<td valign="top">oh good doctor! :) I love the green bg against the red hair and lingerie. Not keen on the water, makes it look like she''s got hives on her boob, but otherwise a fantastic entry! Love the selective sort of lighting. its great!</td>', 'oh good doctor! :) I love the green bg against the red hair and lingerie. Not keen on the water, makes it look like she''s got hives on her boob, but otherwise a fantastic entry! Love the selective sort of lighting. its great!', '2004-08-24 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(874400, 98992, 7889, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the challenge, its excellent, love the lighting and the pose. I might even like it more if it was in b&amp;w. Good luck.</td>', 'My favourite of the challenge, its excellent, love the lighting and the pose. I might even like it more if it was in b&w. Good luck.', '2004-08-24 15:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
