(874463, 98992, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like it how her hair provides the main leading lines in this image. Good to cover her breast like that, makes it more seductive. Not sure about the glasses. Nice high key lighting.</td>', 'I like it how her hair provides the main leading lines in this image. Good to cover her breast like that, makes it more seductive. Not sure about the glasses. Nice high key lighting.', '2004-08-24 16:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
