(874467, 99418, 4008, '<td valign="top">a double exposure in camera (or extremely identical twins). Nice idea, but the poses makes this still two separate images for me, could have chosen poses which showed some more interaction.</td>', 'a double exposure in camera (or extremely identical twins). Nice idea, but the poses makes this still two separate images for me, could have chosen poses which showed some more interaction.', '2004-08-24 16:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(874468, 99354, 4008, '<td valign="top">I probably would have rotated this image 90 degrees clockwise. They seem to be floating in mid air and the angle of view is rather strange for me.</td>', 'I probably would have rotated this image 90 degrees clockwise. They seem to be floating in mid air and the angle of view is rather strange for me.', '2004-08-24 16:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(874469, 98744, 4008, '<td valign="top">nice idea and lighting. Could have done with some more symmetry.</td>', 'nice idea and lighting. Could have done with some more symmetry.', '2004-08-24 16:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(874471, 99174, 4008, '<td valign="top">she could look a bit more happy, nothing to be sad about. not sure about the cropping here, misses some impact, don''t know exactly why.</td>', 'she could look a bit more happy, nothing to be sad about. not sure about the cropping here, misses some impact, don''t know exactly why.', '2004-08-24 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(874473, 98563, 4008, '<td valign="top">a classic, I remember something like this from advertisements (Levi''s ?, with the button loose ?). Nice contrast between body and jeans, bit soft on the top right.</td>', 'a classic, I remember something like this from advertisements (Levi''s ?, with the button loose ?). Nice contrast between body and jeans, bit soft on the top right.', '2004-08-24 16:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(874476, 99226, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would not have emphasised her scar. She has a beatiful face and with a more flattering pose she and the whole image would have become more attractive. Also a more attractive background would have helped, rather dull at the moment.</td>', 'I would not have emphasised her scar. She has a beatiful face and with a more flattering pose she and the whole image would have become more attractive. Also a more attractive background would have helped, rather dull at the moment.', '2004-08-24 16:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(874478, 99407, 4008, '<td valign="top">great idea, great image, I like the pose and the one cloud in the sky, plus the division of light and dark in this image.</td>', 'great idea, great image, I like the pose and the one cloud in the sky, plus the division of light and dark in this image.', '2004-08-24 16:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(874479, 99247, 4008, '<td valign="top">this one you need to frame. Such a soft expression of such a time in life to cherish, to remember. For once, the border also works well here, it really adds to the image.</td>', 'this one you need to frame. Such a soft expression of such a time in life to cherish, to remember. For once, the border also works well here, it really adds to the image.', '2004-08-24 16:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(874484, 98987, 4008, '<td valign="top">nice idea, great lighting, but some remarks : this image in my opinion needs perfect symmetry, also in the background light, which is not the case. Also I see blue area''s on the body which I find distracting, also because these are not symmetrical.</td>', 'nice idea, great lighting, but some remarks : this image in my opinion needs perfect symmetry, also in the background light, which is not the case. Also I see blue area''s on the body which I find distracting, also because these are not symmetrical.', '2004-08-24 16:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(874487, 99420, 4008, '<td valign="top">yes, this works really well, the hands, the red dress, the B&amp;W, the cropping, it all fits very well together in my opinion.</td>', 'yes, this works really well, the hands, the red dress, the B&W, the cropping, it all fits very well together in my opinion.', '2004-08-24 16:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(874491, 99252, 4008, '<td valign="top">nice soft light to emphasise her contours, also on her back. Not sure whether she should be looking away, I would rather expect a tender look downwards (although that would it make a more standard image).</td>', 'nice soft light to emphasise her contours, also on her back. Not sure whether she should be looking away, I would rather expect a tender look downwards (although that would it make a more standard image).', '2004-08-24 16:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(874495, 99240, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice composition, interesting shot.</td>', 'Good lighting, nice composition, interesting shot.', '2004-08-24 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(874500, 99401, 4008, '<td valign="top">she is always a great model and I love the combination of colors here. Are those water drops on her body ? Those drops and the light on the area around her nipple, bringing out the structure, for me bring this image slightly down, a more soft lighting and clean body would increase the contrast with the hard wall for me.</td>', 'she is always a great model and I love the combination of colors here. Are those water drops on her body ? Those drops and the light on the area around her nipple, bringing out the structure, for me bring this image slightly down, a more soft lighting and clean body would increase the contrast with the hard wall for me.', '2004-08-24 17:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(874501, 99259, 4008, '<td valign="top">hard to see whether those are real people or dummies, which makes this image also special. I like it.</td>', 'hard to see whether those are real people or dummies, which makes this image also special. I like it.', '2004-08-24 17:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(874504, 99337, 4008, '<td valign="top">funny, have to keep the shoes on !!!! You could have done some more with the background, for example some olympic rings. The idea is good but the light and color  bring this image down for me. 6 for now.</td>', 'funny, have to keep the shoes on !!!! You could have done some more with the background, for example some olympic rings. The idea is good but the light and color  bring this image down for me. 6 for now.', '2004-08-24 17:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(874506, 98721, 4008, '<td valign="top">beatiful. great light to bring out the shape of the body and muscles., pose is perfect symmetrical. Shadows are a bit distracting but I guess that is hard to avoid, I would expect that any lighting that avoids the shadows also reduced the shadows/tones in the body. 9 for now.</td>', 'beatiful. great light to bring out the shape of the body and muscles., pose is perfect symmetrical. Shadows are a bit distracting but I guess that is hard to avoid, I would expect that any lighting that avoids the shadows also reduced the shadows/tones in the body. 9 for now.', '2004-08-24 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(874509, 99414, 4008, '<td valign="top">alway special to me, since I am one of twins as well. I would have brought them more to the middle by cropping away some of the right part of the image, nice light and tones.</td>', 'alway special to me, since I am one of twins as well. I would have brought them more to the middle by cropping away some of the right part of the image, nice light and tones.', '2004-08-24 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(874510, 99226, 7040, '<td valign="top">Life lines (not scars) add character to any subject.<br/>This photo is enhanced by the creativity of the lens man and the willingness of the model.<br/>Great photo.</td>', 'Life lines (not scars) add character to any subject.This photo is enhanced by the creativity of the lens man and the willingness of the model.Great photo.', '2004-08-24 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(874515, 99020, 4008, '<td valign="top">nice curves, nice hair, nice face, I like her expression. The light is nice and soft but I do see some greenish tints on her body, especially close to her hair. I find the placement of her hands and the fact that they push her breasts out of shape less attractive. Good cropping</td>', 'nice curves, nice hair, nice face, I like her expression. The light is nice and soft but I do see some greenish tints on her body, especially close to her hair. I find the placement of her hands and the fact that they push her breasts out of shape less attractive. Good cropping', '2004-08-24 17:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(874531, 98255, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I like the triangle created by the creases as her legs meet her torso. The inclusion of a segment of the thick black stocking gives the image an anchor. I''m wondering whether I''d prefer the use of a model with pubes to provide some dark details at the top to balance with that dense block of black but I''m not sure - perhaps it''s the simplicity that works best - there is so little detail in the flesh that it almost makes it seem like a statue, not real at all. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice composition - I like the triangle created by the creases as her legs meet her torso. The inclusion of a segment of the thick black stocking gives the image an anchor. I''m wondering whether I''d prefer the use of a model with pubes to provide some dark details at the top to balance with that dense block of black but I''m not sure - perhaps it''s the simplicity that works best - there is so little detail in the flesh that it almost makes it seem like a statue, not real at all. Nice job.', '2004-08-24 17:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(874540, 99055, 24642, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot,  I like the smooth tone. Clever viewpoint and DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful shot,  I like the smooth tone. Clever viewpoint and DOF.', '2004-08-24 17:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(874541, 99122, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting image, I like that I can FEEL his fingers in her flesh as he lifts her.</td>', 'An interesting image, I like that I can FEEL his fingers in her flesh as he lifts her.', '2004-08-24 17:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(874542, 98655, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments.<br/> <br/>First, a very smart concept and very good execution. This is headed straoght to the top.</td>', 'returning for comments. First, a very smart concept and very good execution. This is headed straoght to the top.', '2004-08-24 17:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(874543, 99252, 21362, '<td valign="top">A classic shot, and beautifully done. I''m not sure there''s anything more beautiful than a pregnant woman. I''m not 100% sold on the expression on her face... I think maybe something more serene with downcast eyes. Or maybe just pushing that strand of hair back that casts a shadow on her face. That''s being highly critical though. It''s a great image with high marks from me. Good luck!</td>', 'A classic shot, and beautifully done. I''m not sure there''s anything more beautiful than a pregnant woman. I''m not 100% sold on the expression on her face... I think maybe something more serene with downcast eyes. Or maybe just pushing that strand of hair back that casts a shadow on her face. That''s being highly critical though. It''s a great image with high marks from me. Good luck!', '2004-08-24 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(874544, 99259, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and I like the somewhat jumbled composition - works well for the subject. I like the inclusion of the single face and eyes and would like it to be just a touch further into the frame.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and I like the somewhat jumbled composition - works well for the subject. I like the inclusion of the single face and eyes and would like it to be just a touch further into the frame.', '2004-08-24 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
