(874550, 98992, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this - there is just the right amount of negative space to the left and right and I like how you crop into her head and breast to create an intimate feel. Expression works well, blown out highlights do too because they make her melt into the background a touch whilst also standing proud. A contradiction. Nice image!</td>', 'I really like the composition of this - there is just the right amount of negative space to the left and right and I like how you crop into her head and breast to create an intimate feel. Expression works well, blown out highlights do too because they make her melt into the background a touch whilst also standing proud. A contradiction. Nice image!', '2004-08-24 17:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(874553, 98721, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice pose to create a dynamic shape. I like the inclusion of wrinkles in the fabric - they provide a nice additional detail.</td>', 'Nice pose to create a dynamic shape. I like the inclusion of wrinkles in the fabric - they provide a nice additional detail.', '2004-08-24 17:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
