(874561, 99265, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and capture. I gave it a 9. A darker background (to provide more contrast with the subject) and less shadows (behind the model, around the fingers and the background fold) would probably make it a 10.</td>', 'Nice pose and capture. I gave it a 9. A darker background (to provide more contrast with the subject) and less shadows (behind the model, around the fingers and the background fold) would probably make it a 10.', '2004-08-24 17:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
