(874656, 99421, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 4<br/>Subject Appeal: 7<br/>Compositional Appeal: 6<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 5<br/>Creativity: 7<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 8<br/>Title: 10<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This is a very strong idea.  I love the thought process behind this image.  This photo needs a little perfection in the exposure though.  There is some blurriness that appears to be motion blur which is causing it to be unsharp.  "Soft Focus" would be nice here as  well, but the ''out of focus'' is not quite the same thing.  The dark background is a good choice for subject separation, but it could possibly stand to be a little darker as well.</td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 4Subject Appeal: 7Compositional Appeal: 6Effective use of color/bw: 5Creativity: 7Theme/Storytelling qualities: 8Title: 10 Additional Comments: This is a very strong idea.  I love the thought process behind this image.  This photo needs a little perfection in the exposure though.  There is some blurriness that appears to be motion blur which is causing it to be unsharp.  "Soft Focus" would be nice here as  well, but the ''out of focus'' is not quite the same thing.  The dark background is a good choice for subject separation, but it could possibly stand to be a little darker as well.', '2004-08-24 18:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
