(874671, 99115, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 6<br/>Subject Appeal: 6<br/>Compositional Appeal: 5<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 5<br/>Creativity: 5<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 7<br/>Title: 4<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This photo is interesting on its own, but the impact of what you have presented here is not photographic in nature.  Overall, the artwork is excellent, but it could possibly suffer here at DPC since the ''photograph'' is of higher interest than the impact created by post processing.   As I look at what I see here, I believe that the original photo would probably be a better presentation for the challenge.  <br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 6Subject Appeal: 6Compositional Appeal: 5Effective use of color/bw: 5Creativity: 5Theme/Storytelling qualities: 7Title: 4 Additional Comments: This photo is interesting on its own, but the impact of what you have presented here is not photographic in nature.  Overall, the artwork is excellent, but it could possibly suffer here at DPC since the ''photograph'' is of higher interest than the impact created by post processing.   As I look at what I see here, I believe that the original photo would probably be a better presentation for the challenge.  ', '2004-08-24 18:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
