(874856, 98668, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this shot very much.  The orangeness is what really makes this photo for me.  I like the angle and framing and your focus and clarity seem to be really good as well.  LIghting is also nice.  Nothing to complain about here.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like the colors in this shot very much.  The orangeness is what really makes this photo for me.  I like the angle and framing and your focus and clarity seem to be really good as well.  LIghting is also nice.  Nothing to complain about here.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-08-24 20:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(874857, 99337, 7711, '<td valign="top">great concept! Would have been really cool if the wheels were in motion. Also, the focus is off on the head of the model, which sort of throws me. I like that you have left a slight colouration on the shot..gives it a little something extra.</td>', 'great concept! Would have been really cool if the wheels were in motion. Also, the focus is off on the head of the model, which sort of throws me. I like that you have left a slight colouration on the shot..gives it a little something extra.', '2004-08-24 20:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(874858, 99252, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very lovely photo.  I wish her face were lit a bit more, but otherwise, very nice.  I like how the light is on her belly, and I like the overall softness of the photo.  Angle and framing are nice.  I wonder how it would look with her looking forwards.  Nothing distracting inthe background.  Overall very nice.  ~Heather~</td>', 'A very lovely photo.  I wish her face were lit a bit more, but otherwise, very nice.  I like how the light is on her belly, and I like the overall softness of the photo.  Angle and framing are nice.  I wonder how it would look with her looking forwards.  Nothing distracting inthe background.  Overall very nice.  ~Heather~', '2004-08-24 20:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(874859, 99055, 7711, '<td valign="top">the little bit of OOF hair on the right distracts from the curves of the shot, which I think is a great theme to go with when doing a nude.</td>', 'the little bit of OOF hair on the right distracts from the curves of the shot, which I think is a great theme to go with when doing a nude.', '2004-08-24 20:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(874864, 99413, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately nude.  There are a lot of things here that I think could use improvement.  First, and most noticable are the red eyes.  Use the red eye reducer if you have it, or use natural light and not the flash.  Focus is a bit soft, and the lighting is very dim and dull.  The baby is adorable, but I think the photo does not do him justice.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately nude.  There are a lot of things here that I think could use improvement.  First, and most noticable are the red eyes.  Use the red eye reducer if you have it, or use natural light and not the flash.  Focus is a bit soft, and the lighting is very dim and dull.  The baby is adorable, but I think the photo does not do him justice.  ~Heather~', '2004-08-24 20:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(874869, 99421, 7711, '<td valign="top">couple of things made this image not work for me: the look of disdain on the female model''s face and the fact that we can''t even see the male model''s face..makes the whole image seem sordid in an emotionally painful way. As well, the focus being off makes it seem more like a one off shot. I hope this is helpful. I think the idea you were working with is wonderful.</td>', 'couple of things made this image not work for me: the look of disdain on the female model''s face and the fact that we can''t even see the male model''s face..makes the whole image seem sordid in an emotionally painful way. As well, the focus being off makes it seem more like a one off shot. I hope this is helpful. I think the idea you were working with is wonderful.', '2004-08-24 21:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(874872, 99287, 3080, '<td valign="top">There is a glow all the way around your model.  Looks like a selection tool used.  While legal in the advanced editing rules, I think it didn''t go very smoothly in this case.  The editing mistakes are very obvious and distract from the overall feel of the photo in my opinion.  I think that the desat of the body is nice, but would rather have the color than the halo around the girl.  Very nice idea, and focus and clarity are good.  Lighting looks to have been great.  I love the shadows of the leaves on her body.  I also like how she is not in the center of the photo, but off to the side. ~Heather~</td>', 'There is a glow all the way around your model.  Looks like a selection tool used.  While legal in the advanced editing rules, I think it didn''t go very smoothly in this case.  The editing mistakes are very obvious and distract from the overall feel of the photo in my opinion.  I think that the desat of the body is nice, but would rather have the color than the halo around the girl.  Very nice idea, and focus and clarity are good.  Lighting looks to have been great.  I love the shadows of the leaves on her body.  I also like how she is not in the center of the photo, but off to the side. ~Heather~', '2004-08-24 21:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(874878, 99150, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot.  I think my favorite so far.  Love the color and the angle and framing/cropping are excellent.  I like how this is very diagonal and leads you right into the photo.  Focus and clarity are perfect and I just love it.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Really neat shot.  I think my favorite so far.  Love the color and the angle and framing/cropping are excellent.  I like how this is very diagonal and leads you right into the photo.  Focus and clarity are perfect and I just love it.  ~Heather~', '2004-08-24 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
