(875117, 99365, 472, '<td valign="top">absolutely hideous.</td>', 'absolutely hideous.', '2004-08-24 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(875127, 99076, 25150, '<td valign="top">This is very funny. Great idea and executed very well. Slight blur on the foot kinda takes away from the whole image quality, either make it have MORE movement (which I would like) or stop the movement completely with a fast shutter speed. Good job!</td>', 'This is very funny. Great idea and executed very well. Slight blur on the foot kinda takes away from the whole image quality, either make it have MORE movement (which I would like) or stop the movement completely with a fast shutter speed. Good job!', '2004-08-24 22:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(875133, 98563, 25150, '<td valign="top">Very sexy and a nice curve. I really enjoy the feel of the soft light, I don''t personally like the pants on, but that''s just my opinion, I don''t think it compromises your image. Great shot!</td>', 'Very sexy and a nice curve. I really enjoy the feel of the soft light, I don''t personally like the pants on, but that''s just my opinion, I don''t think it compromises your image. Great shot!', '2004-08-24 22:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(875138, 98992, 25150, '<td valign="top">I know this probably sounds repetative.... I really Like borders, but I don''t like this one. I''m sorry. The image is beautiful. I really like the soft color and it''s a nice look in her eyes. The hair over the shoulder is a little distracting but doesn''t ruin your shot at all. Good job :)</td>', 'I know this probably sounds repetative.... I really Like borders, but I don''t like this one. I''m sorry. The image is beautiful. I really like the soft color and it''s a nice look in her eyes. The hair over the shoulder is a little distracting but doesn''t ruin your shot at all. Good job :)', '2004-08-24 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(875146, 99122, 25150, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but I think it needs more light. Also, the whole image seems a little left of center. It''s such a balanced shot, that maybe the mans left hand thumb (center of her breasts) should be dead center of the image on the vertical axis. Thats just my opinion. Good shot overall ;)</td>', 'This is a great shot but I think it needs more light. Also, the whole image seems a little left of center. It''s such a balanced shot, that maybe the mans left hand thumb (center of her breasts) should be dead center of the image on the vertical axis. Thats just my opinion. Good shot overall ;)', '2004-08-24 22:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(875147, 98325, 12827, '<td valign="top">cropped a little too tight for my tastes</td>', 'cropped a little too tight for my tastes', '2004-08-24 22:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(875149, 98372, 25150, '<td valign="top">You should be ashamed of this image!<br/>It''s poorly lit,<br/>bad composition,<br/>a mere snapshot.<br/>looks like you didn''t even try!<br/> <br/>BTW<br/>I love it... a perfect 10 :)</td>', 'You should be ashamed of this image!It''s poorly lit,bad composition,a mere snapshot.looks like you didn''t even try! BTWI love it... a perfect 10 :)', '2004-08-24 22:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(875153, 99337, 25150, '<td valign="top">Excellent form!<br/>The image seems a little too soft and the light maybe should have been placed a little further away to even out the bottom left corner and the top right corner. i like that it fades from light to dark, but I think it needs a little more light on the bottom left.</td>', 'Excellent form!The image seems a little too soft and the light maybe should have been placed a little further away to even out the bottom left corner and the top right corner. i like that it fades from light to dark, but I think it needs a little more light on the bottom left.', '2004-08-24 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
