(875339, 99223, 8953, '<td valign="top">Bold lighting! the lines of this shot almost give it a kenetic feel. I like the pose you had your model take...I wonder how different the feel of this would have been if your model had tilted her head over her left shoulder? still a emotive and interesting image, Well done.</td>', 'Bold lighting! the lines of this shot almost give it a kenetic feel. I like the pose you had your model take...I wonder how different the feel of this would have been if your model had tilted her head over her left shoulder? still a emotive and interesting image, Well done.', '2004-08-25 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(875349, 99421, 24896, '<td valign="top">focus is a little soft and I see some double lines on the males shoulders....maybe its not the focus maybe a little over processed not sure...nice clean background and good skin tones.</td>', 'focus is a little soft and I see some double lines on the males shoulders....maybe its not the focus maybe a little over processed not sure...nice clean background and good skin tones.', '2004-08-25 00:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(875350, 99078, 16965, '<td valign="top">What a great concept!!! I love it!</td>', 'What a great concept!!! I love it!', '2004-08-25 00:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(875352, 98992, 8953, '<td valign="top">fine delicate lines. your models interaction with the camera helps to pull you into the shot. The well placed braids and the whisps of loose hair almost forms a contridiction...which really helps to give a two demensional image a 3D feeling. Well done.</td>', 'fine delicate lines. your models interaction with the camera helps to pull you into the shot. The well placed braids and the whisps of loose hair almost forms a contridiction...which really helps to give a two demensional image a 3D feeling. Well done.', '2004-08-25 00:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(875360, 98992, 16965, '<td valign="top">Great High Tone image....</td>', 'Great High Tone image....', '2004-08-25 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(875362, 99226, 8953, '<td valign="top">The pose of your model sends to the viewer a sense of self confidence. The choice of cropping and the light source adds depth to the overall feeling of the shot. Well Done!</td>', 'The pose of your model sends to the viewer a sense of self confidence. The choice of cropping and the light source adds depth to the overall feeling of the shot. Well Done!', '2004-08-25 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(875363, 98563, 16965, '<td valign="top">Very simplistic, and very well composed!  Perfect!</td>', 'Very simplistic, and very well composed!  Perfect!', '2004-08-25 00:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(875369, 99020, 24896, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh on the shoulder...I dont like her eye being half cropped out. I love the look of her lips and the way her hair is falling....and I think matching nail and lip colour would have been nice.</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh on the shoulder...I dont like her eye being half cropped out. I love the look of her lips and the way her hair is falling....and I think matching nail and lip colour would have been nice.', '2004-08-25 00:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(875372, 99339, 7711, '<td valign="top">what does it for me on this shot is the look she''s giving the camera (even with just the one eye showing!) and the cool zebra effect of the blinds. its wild and very well done. 9</td>', 'what does it for me on this shot is the look she''s giving the camera (even with just the one eye showing!) and the cool zebra effect of the blinds. its wild and very well done. 9', '2004-08-25 00:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(875377, 99093, 24896, '<td valign="top">THIS IS AWESOME!.....Very Funny...and great title to boot. I keep trying to find technical flews but I see the facial expression and and start laughing.  GREAT PIC.</td>', 'THIS IS AWESOME!.....Very Funny...and great title to boot. I keep trying to find technical flews but I see the facial expression and and start laughing.  GREAT PIC.', '2004-08-25 00:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(875385, 99244, 24896, '<td valign="top">Absolutely great...a pregnant woman is just so beautiful...nice pic...but just a little too grainy for me</td>', 'Absolutely great...a pregnant woman is just so beautiful...nice pic...but just a little too grainy for me', '2004-08-25 00:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(875388, 98563, 8953, '<td valign="top">The desaturation, composition, lines of the model, cropping, border even the choice of the jeans well done.</td>', 'The desaturation, composition, lines of the model, cropping, border even the choice of the jeans well done.', '2004-08-25 00:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(875395, 99115, 22975, '<td valign="top">I never thought I''d give a 10 to a bare bottom in this challenge, but your composition is great... it''s like eye candy (the composition, not the bare bottom).  ;)  Great work, very original.</td>', 'I never thought I''d give a 10 to a bare bottom in this challenge, but your composition is great... it''s like eye candy (the composition, not the bare bottom).  ;)  Great work, very original.', '2004-08-25 00:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(875397, 99252, 24896, '<td valign="top">Good lighting but great on her hair and face with the shine and shadows...a darker background would have been nice. a pregnant woman is just so beautiful. Great pic</td>', 'Good lighting but great on her hair and face with the shine and shadows...a darker background would have been nice. a pregnant woman is just so beautiful. Great pic', '2004-08-25 00:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(875398, 99094, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is by far one of the most precious photos I''ve seen on this site.  What an adorable shot of an even more adorable child.  Those eyes are fantastic!!  Good luck!!</td>', 'This is by far one of the most precious photos I''ve seen on this site.  What an adorable shot of an even more adorable child.  Those eyes are fantastic!!  Good luck!!', '2004-08-25 00:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(875404, 98550, 24896, '<td valign="top">soft focus is great for this pic...I dont know if others will agree...well done</td>', 'soft focus is great for this pic...I dont know if others will agree...well done', '2004-08-25 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(875407, 98928, 24896, '<td valign="top">very nice shadows and curves. Sorry I can''t find anything wrong with this pic.</td>', 'very nice shadows and curves. Sorry I can''t find anything wrong with this pic.', '2004-08-25 00:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(875408, 99401, 22975, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this makes the photo look almost like a fantasy... it doesn''t look real.  The contrast between the red and green works perfectly...</td>', 'The lighting in this makes the photo look almost like a fantasy... it doesn''t look real.  The contrast between the red and green works perfectly...', '2004-08-25 00:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(875410, 99252, 22975, '<td valign="top">I love the soft lighting on this.  I was supposed to take one of these shots of a pregnant friend of mine, but she went and had the baby early!!  :)  You can kind of see the uncertainty in her eyes.  Best wishes to mother and baby!</td>', 'I love the soft lighting on this.  I was supposed to take one of these shots of a pregnant friend of mine, but she went and had the baby early!!  :)  You can kind of see the uncertainty in her eyes.  Best wishes to mother and baby!', '2004-08-25 00:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(875413, 98887, 22975, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting... I imagine she''s looking outside, longing for the lover who just left her.  :)  Just the story it tells me.  Great job.</td>', 'Excellent lighting... I imagine she''s looking outside, longing for the lover who just left her.  :)  Just the story it tells me.  Great job.', '2004-08-25 00:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(875423, 99226, 24896, '<td valign="top">I find the lighted side of her a little too sharp (maybe over processed) I prefer the softness of her right side.. good composition, a relaxing pic</td>', 'I find the lighted side of her a little too sharp (maybe over processed) I prefer the softness of her right side.. good composition, a relaxing pic', '2004-08-25 00:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(875424, 99228, 22975, '<td valign="top">I know I like the lighitng in this... but there''s something else that''s intriguing... I mean, you can clearly tell it''s a woman, but there''s a certain sense of androgyny in this... to me, anyway.  It really adds a bit of mystery.  (Please tell your model I don''t think SHE looks androgynous, it''s just the way the photo was taken.  She''s very pretty.  Don''t want to hurt anyone''s feelings.)</td>', 'I know I like the lighitng in this... but there''s something else that''s intriguing... I mean, you can clearly tell it''s a woman, but there''s a certain sense of androgyny in this... to me, anyway.  It really adds a bit of mystery.  (Please tell your model I don''t think SHE looks androgynous, it''s just the way the photo was taken.  She''s very pretty.  Don''t want to hurt anyone''s feelings.)', '2004-08-25 00:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(875428, 99123, 22975, '<td valign="top">LOVES it.  Composition''s great, lighting''s great, interpretation of the challenge''s great... I''m bumping this tasteful entry to a 10.  :)  Good job.</td>', 'LOVES it.  Composition''s great, lighting''s great, interpretation of the challenge''s great... I''m bumping this tasteful entry to a 10.  :)  Good job.', '2004-08-25 00:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
