(877857, 99413, 25150, '<td valign="top">gotta get rid of the red eye! next time, take the lamp shades off of a few lights, and turn off the flash.<br/>you won''t get the shadows or the red eye. red eye occures most often in blue eyed people. It happens much more often if the ambient light is dim. (red eye is caused by a reflection off of the retina, and the red is actually blood that nourishes the eye) do these few things and you''ll have frameable photos for your walls!</td>', 'gotta get rid of the red eye! next time, take the lamp shades off of a few lights, and turn off the flash.you won''t get the shadows or the red eye. red eye occures most often in blue eyed people. It happens much more often if the ambient light is dim. (red eye is caused by a reflection off of the retina, and the red is actually blood that nourishes the eye) do these few things and you''ll have frameable photos for your walls!', '2004-08-25 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
