(878099, 98348, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the way you''ve only used half the face, it puts a unique spin on a very classic  pose.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the way you''ve only used half the face, it puts a unique spin on a very classic  pose.', '2004-08-26 02:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(878100, 99087, 93, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard about this wooden puppet ;)</td>', 'I''ve heard about this wooden puppet ;)', '2004-08-26 02:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(878103, 99076, 93, '<td valign="top">hahah.. very amusing, and well shot. The yellow tone is a little distracting to me, but a matter of personal taste.</td>', 'hahah.. very amusing, and well shot. The yellow tone is a little distracting to me, but a matter of personal taste.', '2004-08-26 02:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(878104, 99257, 93, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.. very winsome and gay..(as in happy/free-loving), and beautifully lighted!</td>', 'I really like this shot.. very winsome and gay..(as in happy/free-loving), and beautifully lighted!', '2004-08-26 02:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(878106, 99150, 93, '<td valign="top">gorgeous.. and a little bit eerie. The blue cast reminds me of crime shows, and the dirt.. blood.  <br/>Or is it just morbid me?  Whatever it is, I adore it.</td>', 'gorgeous.. and a little bit eerie. The blue cast reminds me of crime shows, and the dirt.. blood.  Or is it just morbid me?  Whatever it is, I adore it.', '2004-08-26 02:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(878107, 98655, 93, '<td valign="top">I think it''s underlit just a touch.  I''d like to maybe see other takes of this when the challenge is done?</td>', 'I think it''s underlit just a touch.  I''d like to maybe see other takes of this when the challenge is done?', '2004-08-26 02:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(878108, 99337, 93, '<td valign="top">I like the social commentary of this. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the social commentary of this. Nicely done.', '2004-08-26 02:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(878113, 98372, 93, '<td valign="top">underlit in my eyes. I''d have liked to see more of the facial/head area, but nicely composed otherwise</td>', 'underlit in my eyes. I''d have liked to see more of the facial/head area, but nicely composed otherwise', '2004-08-26 02:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(878115, 99406, 93, '<td valign="top">aww.. such a tender moment.</td>', 'aww.. such a tender moment.', '2004-08-26 02:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(878116, 99093, 93, '<td valign="top">*snicker*</td>', '*snicker*', '2004-08-26 02:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(878117, 99335, 93, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I have one suggestion. centering the two figures in shot would have made this much stronger, compositionally, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like this, but I have one suggestion. centering the two figures in shot would have made this much stronger, compositionally, in my opinion.', '2004-08-26 02:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(878120, 99117, 93, '<td valign="top">nice "out of the box" idea.  I feel that the lighting is wrong however. Perhaps another source from above and to the right?</td>', 'nice "out of the box" idea.  I feel that the lighting is wrong however. Perhaps another source from above and to the right?', '2004-08-26 02:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(878122, 98721, 93, '<td valign="top">beautiful pose and composition.  I''d suggest another light source on the left.. but muted, so as not to drown the shadow, which is wonderful, and perhaps a closer crop at the top.</td>', 'beautiful pose and composition.  I''d suggest another light source on the left.. but muted, so as not to drown the shadow, which is wonderful, and perhaps a closer crop at the top.', '2004-08-26 02:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(878124, 99252, 93, '<td valign="top">You''re so lucky to have a pregnant model to work with..  I think that nudes of pregnancy are some of the most beautiful on the planet, and you''ve done a wonderful job capturing your model.  I think a touch more light to highlight her face would have been a bonus, but this is a great shot.</td>', 'You''re so lucky to have a pregnant model to work with..  I think that nudes of pregnancy are some of the most beautiful on the planet, and you''ve done a wonderful job capturing your model.  I think a touch more light to highlight her face would have been a bonus, but this is a great shot.', '2004-08-26 02:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(878125, 99415, 93, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Soft and flattering lighting.</td>', 'Very nice!  Soft and flattering lighting.', '2004-08-26 02:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(878126, 99420, 93, '<td valign="top">nice use of selective desaturation here. It borders a little too much on eroticism for *my* tastes, but that doesn''t really compromise the quality of the photo.</td>', 'nice use of selective desaturation here. It borders a little too much on eroticism for *my* tastes, but that doesn''t really compromise the quality of the photo.', '2004-08-26 02:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(878127, 98207, 93, '<td valign="top">great concept :)</td>', 'great concept :)', '2004-08-26 02:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(878128, 99265, 93, '<td valign="top">very nice pose.. it''s pretty original, and I like the lighting.</td>', 'very nice pose.. it''s pretty original, and I like the lighting.', '2004-08-26 02:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(878131, 98519, 93, '<td valign="top">oy.. you touched my morbid bone :)  wonderful, if sick, concept.</td>', 'oy.. you touched my morbid bone :)  wonderful, if sick, concept.', '2004-08-26 03:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(878134, 99264, 93, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Poor baby :)</td>', 'I really like this shot. Poor baby :)', '2004-08-26 03:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(878136, 99421, 20889, '<td valign="top">If the background was more black and was sharpened a bit more think this would have help you out alot. Just looks like his right shoulder is blurry.</td>', 'If the background was more black and was sharpened a bit more think this would have help you out alot. Just looks like his right shoulder is blurry.', '2004-08-26 03:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(878150, 99420, 20889, '<td valign="top">This is good shot. Its got a bit of noise on the bottom of the photo, so I was curious and pulled it up and used neat image on it only removing half the noise and man what a difference it made on the red....9</td>', 'This is good shot. Its got a bit of noise on the bottom of the photo, so I was curious and pulled it up and used neat image on it only removing half the noise and man what a difference it made on the red....9', '2004-08-26 03:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(878158, 98850, 4008, '<td valign="top">very nice light effects, good strong contrast matching the dark haired male, good expression. edit : coming back after full voting this image moves up, the more I see it the more I like it, great graphic quality.</td>', 'very nice light effects, good strong contrast matching the dark haired male, good expression. edit : coming back after full voting this image moves up, the more I see it the more I like it, great graphic quality.', '2004-08-26 03:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(878185, 98408, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colour and lighting work well. This image has a mellow sort of tone. The composition seems to lack a strong focal point. The image does look a bit "chopped off" on the right hand side. The tone and light are beautiful though.</td>', 'The colour and lighting work well. This image has a mellow sort of tone. The composition seems to lack a strong focal point. The image does look a bit "chopped off" on the right hand side. The tone and light are beautiful though.', '2004-08-26 05:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(878186, 99385, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image. It really captures a mood of disorganisation. The red colouring doesn''t really work for me personally I think it detracts from the impact of the composition. I think black and white may have been interesting as well. I think the space on the top half of the image adds to the impact of the mood.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image. It really captures a mood of disorganisation. The red colouring doesn''t really work for me personally I think it detracts from the impact of the composition. I think black and white may have been interesting as well. I think the space on the top half of the image adds to the impact of the mood.', '2004-08-26 05:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(878187, 99065, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this image has been artistically executed. The image portrays a sense of strength combined with suppleness, like a quiet gentle strength. I think this image could also be cropped tight around the hands and shoulder area because this central area of the photo seems to be a condensed representation of the whole image. Its a beautiful image.</td>', 'The lighting in this image has been artistically executed. The image portrays a sense of strength combined with suppleness, like a quiet gentle strength. I think this image could also be cropped tight around the hands and shoulder area because this central area of the photo seems to be a condensed representation of the whole image. Its a beautiful image.', '2004-08-26 05:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(878188, 99241, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this image is excellent. The skin tones contrast well with the black and white fabric.</td>', 'The lighting in this image is excellent. The skin tones contrast well with the black and white fabric.', '2004-08-26 05:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(878189, 98721, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image makes quite an impact. The contrasty lighting really defines the form. Its perhaps just a touch too strong for my liking. The highlight on his left forearm is a little distracting and is shown up more by the contrasting shadows on his right arm.(by the way I''m nit-picking here because I really like the image.) I think the crumpled fabric adds a nice touch of softness on the left of the image. Its a well executed shot and there''s just a couple of finishing touches that would have finished it off.</td>', 'This image makes quite an impact. The contrasty lighting really defines the form. Its perhaps just a touch too strong for my liking. The highlight on his left forearm is a little distracting and is shown up more by the contrasting shadows on his right arm.(by the way I''m nit-picking here because I really like the image.) I think the crumpled fabric adds a nice touch of softness on the left of the image. Its a well executed shot and there''s just a couple of finishing touches that would have finished it off.', '2004-08-26 05:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(878192, 99226, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. At first glance it doesn''t greatly appeal to me. When I look at it a bit longer though I notice the curve of her pose on the left of the image and the expression on her face. The lighting is a little harsh down her right side. It is good how it highlights the curves though. I''m wondering if this could have been enhanced by using a dark backdrop and some sort of diffusion for the light. The image has a subtle beauty about it which is the most difficult aspect to capture or produce.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. At first glance it doesn''t greatly appeal to me. When I look at it a bit longer though I notice the curve of her pose on the left of the image and the expression on her face. The lighting is a little harsh down her right side. It is good how it highlights the curves though. I''m wondering if this could have been enhanced by using a dark backdrop and some sort of diffusion for the light. The image has a subtle beauty about it which is the most difficult aspect to capture or produce.', '2004-08-26 05:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(878213, 99123, 23300, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting and composition. I like the way that the shadows extend up from the foreground into her left arm and leg.</td>', 'Superb lighting and composition. I like the way that the shadows extend up from the foreground into her left arm and leg.', '2004-08-26 06:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(878215, 99180, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent. The composition is unusual and interesting. I really like the way the model fades off into the shadows in some parts of the image.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent. The composition is unusual and interesting. I really like the way the model fades off into the shadows in some parts of the image.', '2004-08-26 07:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(878224, 99287, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition and depth of field work really well. I really like the shadows on her chest as a compliment to the leaves in her hand. Its an unusual image in that the desaturation makes her look a bit deathly which seems to contradict the title. She would have passed for a statue except for the pink in some parts of her skin. Technically its a very well executed image. I''m not sure what the purpose of the desaturation is. I would be curious to see it in its original colours or entirely black and white. Good Luck.</td>', 'The composition and depth of field work really well. I really like the shadows on her chest as a compliment to the leaves in her hand. Its an unusual image in that the desaturation makes her look a bit deathly which seems to contradict the title. She would have passed for a statue except for the pink in some parts of her skin. Technically its a very well executed image. I''m not sure what the purpose of the desaturation is. I would be curious to see it in its original colours or entirely black and white. Good Luck.', '2004-08-26 07:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(878235, 98291, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent. I like the contrast between the lightness of her skin and the darkness of the material. The highlights on the material create interest also.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent. I like the contrast between the lightness of her skin and the darkness of the material. The highlights on the material create interest also.', '2004-08-26 07:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(878237, 99191, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition are excellent and have been implemented artistically. I like the contrast between the light bottom right and the dark top left.</td>', 'The lighting and composition are excellent and have been implemented artistically. I like the contrast between the light bottom right and the dark top left.', '2004-08-26 07:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(878249, 99123, 3306, '<td valign="top">Incredible grace, lighting and mood. top 3.</td>', 'Incredible grace, lighting and mood. top 3.', '2004-08-26 08:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(878250, 99228, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Top 3</td>', 'Beautifully done. Top 3', '2004-08-26 08:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(878269, 99287, 13759, '<td valign="top">Do you use desaturation on the body? It is so grey. The leafs shdows at breats are a bit strange too. I Like it, but prefer the original skin tone.</td>', 'Do you use desaturation on the body? It is so grey. The leafs shdows at breats are a bit strange too. I Like it, but prefer the original skin tone.', '2004-08-26 08:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(878271, 98590, 13759, '<td valign="top">The feather... very original, a bit artificial too! But is funny.</td>', 'The feather... very original, a bit artificial too! But is funny.', '2004-08-26 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(878277, 98550, 13759, '<td valign="top">The soft focus, unsharpned image works very well. It seems like a picture. Great shot. I saw some piece of something in the nose at bottom, may be a piercing that at first... third... look seems to be a noise distracting thing.</td>', 'The soft focus, unsharpned image works very well. It seems like a picture. Great shot. I saw some piece of something in the nose at bottom, may be a piercing that at first... third... look seems to be a noise distracting thing.', '2004-08-26 08:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(878281, 99228, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great light, very nice use to B&amp;W</td>', 'Great light, very nice use to B&W', '2004-08-26 08:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(878425, 99118, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice orientation, but looks a bit overphotoshopped noise is fine to me the lose of image info in the hair isn''t to my liking. 8...could''ve been a contender :)</td>', 'nice orientation, but looks a bit overphotoshopped noise is fine to me the lose of image info in the hair isn''t to my liking. 8...could''ve been a contender :)', '2004-08-26 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(878430, 99078, 20018, '<td valign="top">great idea...but the execution is a bit off. the hand could''ve been painted better, nice attempt though.</td>', 'great idea...but the execution is a bit off. the hand could''ve been painted better, nice attempt though.', '2004-08-26 11:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(878435, 98519, 20018, '<td valign="top">great shot but need a bit more transparency to see more of the figure</td>', 'great shot but need a bit more transparency to see more of the figure', '2004-08-26 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(878439, 99361, 20018, '<td valign="top">nice...and even though relatively little flesh is shown, it is gratuitously insinuated</td>', 'nice...and even though relatively little flesh is shown, it is gratuitously insinuated', '2004-08-26 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(878441, 99335, 20018, '<td valign="top">interesting, but the border is bit large for me (not distracting enough to lose points over though)</td>', 'interesting, but the border is bit large for me (not distracting enough to lose points over though)', '2004-08-26 11:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(878443, 99055, 20018, '<td valign="top">great, interesting compostion</td>', 'great, interesting compostion', '2004-08-26 11:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(878447, 98960, 20018, '<td valign="top">lighting seems a bit harsh/stark</td>', 'lighting seems a bit harsh/stark', '2004-08-26 11:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(878450, 99094, 20018, '<td valign="top">great... but the light maybe could''ve been reduced a little</td>', 'great... but the light maybe could''ve been reduced a little', '2004-08-26 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(878452, 98721, 20018, '<td valign="top">looks a bit soft at the fingertips but a very interesting pose</td>', 'looks a bit soft at the fingertips but a very interesting pose', '2004-08-26 11:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(878455, 99223, 20018, '<td valign="top">lighting could really make this photo, the pose could definitely be improved</td>', 'lighting could really make this photo, the pose could definitely be improved', '2004-08-26 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(878459, 98621, 20018, '<td valign="top">a tad soft and whites are blown out</td>', 'a tad soft and whites are blown out', '2004-08-26 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(878460, 99226, 20018, '<td valign="top">light is a bit harsh, but i enjoy the unabashed pose</td>', 'light is a bit harsh, but i enjoy the unabashed pose', '2004-08-26 11:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(878461, 98987, 20018, '<td valign="top">how did you make the rope stay on the head?</td>', 'how did you make the rope stay on the head?', '2004-08-26 11:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(878464, 98902, 20018, '<td valign="top">socks are a great touch</td>', 'socks are a great touch', '2004-08-26 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(878465, 99093, 20018, '<td valign="top">great expression</td>', 'great expression', '2004-08-26 11:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(878467, 99365, 20018, '<td valign="top">no, no, no...like a car wreck</td>', 'no, no, no...like a car wreck', '2004-08-26 11:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(878475, 99252, 20018, '<td valign="top">almost unrealistically sharp, facial expression doesnt work for me as well as the left arm looks overly posed, I''m very jealous of such a great model though 6 for a nice try</td>', 'almost unrealistically sharp, facial expression doesnt work for me as well as the left arm looks overly posed, I''m very jealous of such a great model though 6 for a nice try', '2004-08-26 11:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(878541, 98928, 25388, '<td valign="top">good use of light; good use of classic figures; the similiarity of shapes is well imaged.</td>', 'good use of light; good use of classic figures; the similiarity of shapes is well imaged.', '2004-08-26 12:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(878548, 99055, 25388, '<td valign="top">i gave you a 7 at first; but the more I see this image the more I realize that my initial  impression  that the DOF is too shallow and the lighting a llittle too dark has now changed: the DOF and lighting on the left breast gives this image an artistic mystery and makes one use your imagination. This nude is artistic and done in ecellent taste. Congratulations</td>', 'i gave you a 7 at first; but the more I see this image the more I realize that my initial  impression  that the DOF is too shallow and the lighting a llittle too dark has now changed: the DOF and lighting on the left breast gives this image an artistic mystery and makes one use your imagination. This nude is artistic and done in ecellent taste. Congratulations', '2004-08-26 12:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(878549, 99420, 25388, '<td valign="top">great selective desaturation technique; sensual and erotic and tastefuly done</td>', 'great selective desaturation technique; sensual and erotic and tastefuly done', '2004-08-26 12:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(878559, 98721, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very creatively done..love the white background and the way the lighting has been handled to create shadows which show the creases and folds of the covers..has an almost old fashioned "vignetting " feel to it.<br/>Without doubt the best piece of work I`ve seen in the challenge.<br/>Good luck...10</td>', 'Very creatively done..love the white background and the way the lighting has been handled to create shadows which show the creases and folds of the covers..has an almost old fashioned "vignetting " feel to it.Without doubt the best piece of work I`ve seen in the challenge.Good luck...10', '2004-08-26 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(878563, 98902, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of originality..love the tonal effect as well...9</td>', 'Nice bit of originality..love the tonal effect as well...9', '2004-08-26 13:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(878585, 99076, 26044, '<td valign="top">pretty funny stuff...</td>', 'pretty funny stuff...', '2004-08-26 13:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
