(878798, 99118, 23338, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Nicely contrasted zones from dark hair at base to light skin to dark background at top.  Love the soft feeling.  Curves throughout complement each other and are similarly softly shaped.  Lighting is very effective.  Congratulations on a very nice image.</td>', 'Great composition.  Nicely contrasted zones from dark hair at base to light skin to dark background at top.  Love the soft feeling.  Curves throughout complement each other and are similarly softly shaped.  Lighting is very effective.  Congratulations on a very nice image.', '2004-08-26 15:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
