(878817, 99055, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 8<br/>Subject Appeal: 8 <br/>Compositional Appeal: 10<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 10<br/>Creativity: 8<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: n/a<br/>Title: 6<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>Excellent composition on this photo...  The lighting is also perfect for the image.   The only thing I would consider as an ''alternative'' possibility here would be to not include the hair on the right side of the frame.  I can''t decide if that is adding anything or if it''s distracting.  I do think it takes some amount of ''smoothness'' away from this photo...<br/> <br/>Great shot...</td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 8Subject Appeal: 8 Compositional Appeal: 10Effective use of color/bw: 10Creativity: 8Theme/Storytelling qualities: n/aTitle: 6 Additional Comments: Excellent composition on this photo...  The lighting is also perfect for the image.   The only thing I would consider as an ''alternative'' possibility here would be to not include the hair on the right side of the frame.  I can''t decide if that is adding anything or if it''s distracting.  I do think it takes some amount of ''smoothness'' away from this photo... Great shot...', '2004-08-26 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
