(880039, 98280, 8860, '<td valign="top">A brave and revealing shot. They say a picture''s worth a 1000 words, and this speaks volumes - although it probably leaves more questions than it answers.<br/> <br/>Technically, it''s a bit of a tight crop and there are some distracting highlights from the skirting board.</td>', 'A brave and revealing shot. They say a picture''s worth a 1000 words, and this speaks volumes - although it probably leaves more questions than it answers. Technically, it''s a bit of a tight crop and there are some distracting highlights from the skirting board.', '2004-08-27 10:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(880087, 99365, 11467, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit unflattering here. I think that possibly the flash was used, which makes the image flat.<br/>Use of an external light source from the side would help create shadows and bring out the contours of the body.<br/>A soft focus might help hide any imperfections.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit unflattering here. I think that possibly the flash was used, which makes the image flat.Use of an external light source from the side would help create shadows and bring out the contours of the body.A soft focus might help hide any imperfections.', '2004-08-27 11:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
