(880100, 99337, 11467, '<td valign="top">Great idea.<br/>I think seeing that the person is immediately in front of a wall distracts a bit.<br/>By using a Black cloth or by adjusting the levels so the wall wasn''t evident mas have improved the image.</td>', 'Great idea.I think seeing that the person is immediately in front of a wall distracts a bit.By using a Black cloth or by adjusting the levels so the wall wasn''t evident mas have improved the image.', '2004-08-27 12:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
