(880192, 99020, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is one of the Wow pics from this challenge. Everything about it is absolutely beautiful - the soft focus, the pose, the model, everything. Very nice shot!</td>', 'This is one of the Wow pics from this challenge. Everything about it is absolutely beautiful - the soft focus, the pose, the model, everything. Very nice shot!', '2004-08-27 13:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(880197, 98563, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a great picture and I love the desaturation. It''s just a little hot along the waist, but that''s a minor flaw in a truly beautiful shot. Great job.</td>', 'This is such a great picture and I love the desaturation. It''s just a little hot along the waist, but that''s a minor flaw in a truly beautiful shot. Great job.', '2004-08-27 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(880198, 98902, 19952, '<td valign="top">Not only do you get the prize for having the biggest balls (which we could confirm with just a slight tilt of the camera), but this is a really nicely done photograph. I love the colors, the angle, and the motion blur. Great job!</td>', 'Not only do you get the prize for having the biggest balls (which we could confirm with just a slight tilt of the camera), but this is a really nicely done photograph. I love the colors, the angle, and the motion blur. Great job!', '2004-08-27 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(880201, 98255, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really love the contrast and simplicity in this shot. Very nice job.</td>', 'I really love the contrast and simplicity in this shot. Very nice job.', '2004-08-27 13:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(880206, 98721, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed photograph and I love the effects of the high contrast on the shadowed areas. Really nice job!</td>', 'This is a nicely composed photograph and I love the effects of the high contrast on the shadowed areas. Really nice job!', '2004-08-27 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(880214, 99123, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is just an absolutely beautiful photograph. The composition, lighting and the pose are excellent. Really great job.</td>', 'This is just an absolutely beautiful photograph. The composition, lighting and the pose are excellent. Really great job.', '2004-08-27 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(880216, 99415, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful and simple photograph. It seems just a tad dark, but that could be the effect of the black fishnet and its shadows. Reardless, very nice shot.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful and simple photograph. It seems just a tad dark, but that could be the effect of the black fishnet and its shadows. Reardless, very nice shot.', '2004-08-27 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(880228, 99036, 18985, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2004-08-27 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(880273, 98721, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the lines of his body, despite the unfortunately shadow (it doesn''t seem intentional to me). I also wish for symmetry with the white space on either side of his hand. I think if there was a fill light to the left to get ride of the shadow and also light the right side of his body (the left part of the picture) it would be a more effective shot. 8</td>', 'i like the lines of his body, despite the unfortunately shadow (it doesn''t seem intentional to me). I also wish for symmetry with the white space on either side of his hand. I think if there was a fill light to the left to get ride of the shadow and also light the right side of his body (the left part of the picture) it would be a more effective shot. 8', '2004-08-27 14:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(880275, 99354, 7711, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of a sculpture. I would have preferred the camera to be lower to the ground (and closer to the couple) so that the viewer could share in the intimacy of the shot. I like the use of negative space to isolate the subject.</td>', 'this reminds me of a sculpture. I would have preferred the camera to be lower to the ground (and closer to the couple) so that the viewer could share in the intimacy of the shot. I like the use of negative space to isolate the subject.', '2004-08-27 14:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(880276, 98655, 7711, '<td valign="top">i commented on another shot that it reminded me of a sculpture. This reminds me of Rodin''s work. Beautiful lines on your subject and your choice of lighting really brings forward the idea of a perfect specimen of the human form released from marble or cast in iron. Your use of light and shadow gives the shot a museum exhibit feel too. Well done!</td>', 'i commented on another shot that it reminded me of a sculpture. This reminds me of Rodin''s work. Beautiful lines on your subject and your choice of lighting really brings forward the idea of a perfect specimen of the human form released from marble or cast in iron. Your use of light and shadow gives the shot a museum exhibit feel too. Well done!', '2004-08-27 14:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(880279, 99265, 7711, '<td valign="top">I feel like the key to this shot is the lines of her body since we don''t get to see the expression on her face. I would have wished for an angle that allowed more of her back to be seen or the lines of her legs (maybe a view a bit more to the left?) still very lovely like an interpretive dance.</td>', 'I feel like the key to this shot is the lines of her body since we don''t get to see the expression on her face. I would have wished for an angle that allowed more of her back to be seen or the lines of her legs (maybe a view a bit more to the left?) still very lovely like an interpretive dance.', '2004-08-27 14:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(880280, 98928, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice take on something that has been done before. I don''t care for the selective desaturation, however, as it evokes a rather cold feeling where there should be warmth. Also, I think it would have been nicer if the model''s hair weren''t  unkempt.</td>', 'Nice take on something that has been done before. I don''t care for the selective desaturation, however, as it evokes a rather cold feeling where there should be warmth. Also, I think it would have been nicer if the model''s hair weren''t  unkempt.', '2004-08-27 14:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(880282, 98928, 7711, '<td valign="top">the lines of her body seem to match the lines of the cello (if that is the right instrument). Given that, I wish her hips were not askew but actually mirrored the shape of the instrument since repetition can be very powerful and beautiful. I also would have liked it if some of her body were in shadow like the instrument for more mimicking.</td>', 'the lines of her body seem to match the lines of the cello (if that is the right instrument). Given that, I wish her hips were not askew but actually mirrored the shape of the instrument since repetition can be very powerful and beautiful. I also would have liked it if some of her body were in shadow like the instrument for more mimicking.', '2004-08-27 14:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(880285, 99421, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting and focus. I don''t care for the woman''s expression or pose. She doesn''t appear comfortable being photographed in this manner.</td>', 'Nice soft lighting and focus. I don''t care for the woman''s expression or pose. She doesn''t appear comfortable being photographed in this manner.', '2004-08-27 14:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(880286, 98992, 7322, '<td valign="top">Love the braids, the specs, and the high key lighting. I kind of wish the top of her head weren''t cropped off and I''m not nuts for the desaturated look of her skin.</td>', 'Love the braids, the specs, and the high key lighting. I kind of wish the top of her head weren''t cropped off and I''m not nuts for the desaturated look of her skin.', '2004-08-27 14:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(880288, 99365, 7711, '<td valign="top">easily the toughest image in the challenge to deal with. There is no sense of intimacy with this subject, so we can''t have any sympathy or tolerance of the physical imperfections, leaving us pretty much just shocked and prone to running away. Its just a hairy, spotty bottom and I think this shot has done nothing for the subject, the lighting is harsh, the angle and crop as unflattering as it could possibly be. My apologies. I don''t mean to be harsh on the subject. Its not uncommon for men to have the traits shown in this shot as your model has, but its just not easy on the eyes.</td>', 'easily the toughest image in the challenge to deal with. There is no sense of intimacy with this subject, so we can''t have any sympathy or tolerance of the physical imperfections, leaving us pretty much just shocked and prone to running away. Its just a hairy, spotty bottom and I think this shot has done nothing for the subject, the lighting is harsh, the angle and crop as unflattering as it could possibly be. My apologies. I don''t mean to be harsh on the subject. Its not uncommon for men to have the traits shown in this shot as your model has, but its just not easy on the eyes.', '2004-08-27 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(880292, 99119, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good pose and concept. The flash lighting and the resulting red-eye and flat detail make it look rather like a snapshot. Also, I would prefer that his feet weren''t cut off.</td>', 'Good pose and concept. The flash lighting and the resulting red-eye and flat detail make it look rather like a snapshot. Also, I would prefer that his feet weren''t cut off.', '2004-08-27 14:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(880319, 98348, 22734, '<td valign="top">Now, such sheer innocence combined with this suberb comp elicits the urge to hit the 10. But then, I must control myself. I give it a level headed 9.</td>', 'Now, such sheer innocence combined with this suberb comp elicits the urge to hit the 10. But then, I must control myself. I give it a level headed 9.', '2004-08-27 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
