(880770, 98987, 7711, '<td valign="top">i like the idea of this shot..reminds me of that drawing of a man and a pentacle, but something about it doesn''t work for me..maybe its the outline of your model. She has the gentle curves of a feminine form, but her pose does not really play on that at all. And the fact that I can''t see her face makes this picture unsettling for me. It almost scares me. I think its a very emotional reaction to the shot.</td>', 'i like the idea of this shot..reminds me of that drawing of a man and a pentacle, but something about it doesn''t work for me..maybe its the outline of your model. She has the gentle curves of a feminine form, but her pose does not really play on that at all. And the fact that I can''t see her face makes this picture unsettling for me. It almost scares me. I think its a very emotional reaction to the shot.', '2004-08-27 20:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(880772, 99252, 22659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful! I love the lighting and the choice of b&amp;w. A very pretty model too. My second favourite picture out of the bunch. This looks like a  work of Heida, if not, consider it a compliment. Bumped up from a 9 on my first round of voting to a 10.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful! I love the lighting and the choice of b&w. A very pretty model too. My second favourite picture out of the bunch. This looks like a  work of Heida, if not, consider it a compliment. Bumped up from a 9 on my first round of voting to a 10.', '2004-08-27 20:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(880778, 98887, 22659, '<td valign="top">This is my favouritest picture of the bunch.  I like the way you used the window as a light source and the choice of b&amp;w.  Excellent job!  Bumped you up from a 9 on my first round of voting to a perfect 10.</td>', 'This is my favouritest picture of the bunch.  I like the way you used the window as a light source and the choice of b&w.  Excellent job!  Bumped you up from a 9 on my first round of voting to a perfect 10.', '2004-08-27 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(880779, 99418, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think this shot and idea are grea, and I have no improvements to suggest on lighting. The only thing I''d change is maybe more "negative space" so the girls aren''t crowding each other. ;) (yes I know its a double exposure sort of scenario).</td>', 'i think this shot and idea are grea, and I have no improvements to suggest on lighting. The only thing I''d change is maybe more "negative space" so the girls aren''t crowding each other. ;) (yes I know its a double exposure sort of scenario).', '2004-08-27 20:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(880781, 98519, 7711, '<td valign="top">you''re probably not doing as well as you would like with this shot, but I think its very powerful. The stains on the shower really speak of a desperate struggle and the crumpled, hardly discernable form as seen from the angle we have brilliantly conveys your message. I like this shot a lot, and I think it fits the theme in an unconventional way.</td>', 'you''re probably not doing as well as you would like with this shot, but I think its very powerful. The stains on the shower really speak of a desperate struggle and the crumpled, hardly discernable form as seen from the angle we have brilliantly conveys your message. I like this shot a lot, and I think it fits the theme in an unconventional way.', '2004-08-27 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(880783, 99180, 7711, '<td valign="top">i don''t mind seeing just half her body, but something about how you cropped out her head leaves me unsettled. I like the soft lines of her arm and hand, despite the slightly unnatural pose she has. Either we needed no chin in the shot, or all of the head, I think. I would be curious to see some alternate crops on this (if you feel up to it). Lovely job with the colouring though.</td>', 'i don''t mind seeing just half her body, but something about how you cropped out her head leaves me unsettled. I like the soft lines of her arm and hand, despite the slightly unnatural pose she has. Either we needed no chin in the shot, or all of the head, I think. I would be curious to see some alternate crops on this (if you feel up to it). Lovely job with the colouring though.', '2004-08-27 20:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
