(880829, 98721, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the folds in the backdrop under the model''s knees.  Too bad you didn''t have a second light source coming in from the left to balance the luminosity on both sides of the body.  Great skin tone and good white balance.  Well done.</td>', 'Too bad about the folds in the backdrop under the model''s knees.  Too bad you didn''t have a second light source coming in from the left to balance the luminosity on both sides of the body.  Great skin tone and good white balance.  Well done.', '2004-08-27 21:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(880833, 98991, 11738, '<td valign="top">Can''t seem to understand why her hair is so dark on the left side of her head...  lack of light or is it dyed black?  I would have liked to see her torso turned slightly more towards the camera to give us a better view of the tatoo on her chest.  I know the freckles on the body are hers and keeping them may have been your intention, but I think cloning them out would have made for a cleaner image.</td>', 'Can''t seem to understand why her hair is so dark on the left side of her head...  lack of light or is it dyed black?  I would have liked to see her torso turned slightly more towards the camera to give us a better view of the tatoo on her chest.  I know the freckles on the body are hers and keeping them may have been your intention, but I think cloning them out would have made for a cleaner image.', '2004-08-27 21:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
