(880841, 98120, 11738, '<td valign="top">Lovely girl with a beautiful body and smile, but those blown out highlights really take away from this shot.  The stance of her left had is also strange, but I realize that this was shot was not set up and that it was quickly snapped.  Hope you get the chance to work with her again and share more images of this lovely girl.</td>', 'Lovely girl with a beautiful body and smile, but those blown out highlights really take away from this shot.  The stance of her left had is also strange, but I realize that this was shot was not set up and that it was quickly snapped.  Hope you get the chance to work with her again and share more images of this lovely girl.', '2004-08-27 22:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
