(881144, 99365, 4007, '<td valign="top">I guess this fits the challenge, but I''m not sure what you''re going for here.  I almost get the impression you were trying to take a shot that would be as poorly recieved as possible.  Perhaps the shot is a challenge for us to consider our standards of beauty and compare them with reality.  Perhaps you just like to ruffle feathers.  Either way, in my opinion this is an extremely unappealing shot on an aesthetic level, and I don''t see much else to redeem it.  Good luck to you though.</td>', 'I guess this fits the challenge, but I''m not sure what you''re going for here.  I almost get the impression you were trying to take a shot that would be as poorly recieved as possible.  Perhaps the shot is a challenge for us to consider our standards of beauty and compare them with reality.  Perhaps you just like to ruffle feathers.  Either way, in my opinion this is an extremely unappealing shot on an aesthetic level, and I don''t see much else to redeem it.  Good luck to you though.', '2004-08-28 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(881150, 99413, 4007, '<td valign="top">The image quality here is rather low, with both blurryness and color blotchyness present.<br/>The flash used also created a number of negative effects.  The shadow outlines and the red-eye (even if it has been removed in post-processing) detract greatly from the shot.  Try to use a different light source besides the flash and your results will probably improve.</td>', 'The image quality here is rather low, with both blurryness and color blotchyness present.The flash used also created a number of negative effects.  The shadow outlines and the red-eye (even if it has been removed in post-processing) detract greatly from the shot.  Try to use a different light source besides the flash and your results will probably improve.', '2004-08-28 02:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
