(881270, 99401, 25150, '<td valign="top">I like green and red. It''s so Christmas-y</td>', 'I like green and red. It''s so Christmas-y', '2004-08-28 08:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(881323, 99247, 8624, '<td valign="top">good shot and interesting crop. I would have preferred a wider tonal range though accentuating the shadows and better defining the shapes.</td>', 'good shot and interesting crop. I would have preferred a wider tonal range though accentuating the shadows and better defining the shapes.', '2004-08-28 10:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(881327, 98991, 8624, '<td valign="top">good lighting. I like the pose. persoanlly don''t care for the body art though.</td>', 'good lighting. I like the pose. persoanlly don''t care for the body art though.', '2004-08-28 10:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(881328, 99265, 8624, '<td valign="top">good pose and lighting. might have been more interesting if you could eliminate the line where the floor and wall meet either in post processing or during the shoot using a seamless background.</td>', 'good pose and lighting. might have been more interesting if you could eliminate the line where the floor and wall meet either in post processing or during the shoot using a seamless background.', '2004-08-28 10:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(881335, 99414, 8624, '<td valign="top">great expressions by both kids. wish the crop wasn''t cutting off their feet though. I would either go in tighter and just concentrate on the face and hands or shoot wider to include the whole body.</td>', 'great expressions by both kids. wish the crop wasn''t cutting off their feet though. I would either go in tighter and just concentrate on the face and hands or shoot wider to include the whole body.', '2004-08-28 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(881351, 98120, 656, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really strike me as meeting the challenge.  Certainly a lively expression though the sunlight is pretty harsh on the left side</td>', 'Doesn''t really strike me as meeting the challenge.  Certainly a lively expression though the sunlight is pretty harsh on the left side', '2004-08-28 11:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(881353, 99036, 656, '<td valign="top">Only the title really drags it back in to the challenge for me.  Low score.</td>', 'Only the title really drags it back in to the challenge for me.  Low score.', '2004-08-28 11:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(881354, 99421, 656, '<td valign="top">She looks quite uncomfortable and unhappy in this.  Lighting also appears quite flat and the focus is quite soft/ blurry but doesn''t look intentionally so.  Low score.</td>', 'She looks quite uncomfortable and unhappy in this.  Lighting also appears quite flat and the focus is quite soft/ blurry but doesn''t look intentionally so.  Low score.', '2004-08-28 11:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(881357, 99413, 656, '<td valign="top">Certainly a cute subject and you''ve got in nice and tight.  The red eye is really unpleasant though and the lighting could really be improved a whole lot.  Looks like you used the on camera flash which takes away any flattering, shaping shadows and doesn''t add much back. (e.g., the dark shadow behind the head and so on.  Low score.</td>', 'Certainly a cute subject and you''ve got in nice and tight.  The red eye is really unpleasant though and the lighting could really be improved a whole lot.  Looks like you used the on camera flash which takes away any flattering, shaping shadows and doesn''t add much back. (e.g., the dark shadow behind the head and so on.  Low score.', '2004-08-28 11:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(881358, 99076, 656, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t appeal to me a whole lot.  The painted nails shows some imagination, but the overall ''green'' feel to the whole thing and the clutter in the bath just feels disorganised and last minute.  Low score</td>', 'Doesn''t appeal to me a whole lot.  The painted nails shows some imagination, but the overall ''green'' feel to the whole thing and the clutter in the bath just feels disorganised and last minute.  Low score', '2004-08-28 11:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(881361, 99119, 656, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really work for me.  Feels quite haphazzard/ last minute.  The apparent on camera flash or front lighting doesn''t lend itself to appealingly lit results.  Low score.</td>', 'Doesn''t really work for me.  Feels quite haphazzard/ last minute.  The apparent on camera flash or front lighting doesn''t lend itself to appealingly lit results.  Low score.', '2004-08-28 11:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(881364, 99117, 656, '<td valign="top">Certainly nicely lit.  Some visual irony and structure to it too.  Somehow doesn''t come together to really make me like it though - perhaps too gimmicky ?</td>', 'Certainly nicely lit.  Some visual irony and structure to it too.  Somehow doesn''t come together to really make me like it though - perhaps too gimmicky ?', '2004-08-28 11:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(881391, 99232, 656, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and textures the screen gives to this.  9</td>', 'Love the colours and textures the screen gives to this.  9', '2004-08-28 12:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(881392, 99122, 656, '<td valign="top">great textures and graphic structure.  Hands might be gripping a bit too tight ? 9</td>', 'great textures and graphic structure.  Hands might be gripping a bit too tight ? 9', '2004-08-28 12:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(881396, 98902, 656, '<td valign="top">excellent.  The bright, light, textured yellow is really effective, as is the ''ghosting'' of the naked guy.  10</td>', 'excellent.  The bright, light, textured yellow is really effective, as is the ''ghosting'' of the naked guy.  10', '2004-08-28 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(881398, 99228, 656, '<td valign="top">Only thing I don''t like is the large fall-off on the camera right arm.  Doesn''t quite look deliberate enough to completely dark or light enough to be all there - Not explaining it well, but the way the armm shoulder and breast disappears feels a bit haphazard. 9</td>', 'Only thing I don''t like is the large fall-off on the camera right arm.  Doesn''t quite look deliberate enough to completely dark or light enough to be all there - Not explaining it well, but the way the armm shoulder and breast disappears feels a bit haphazard. 9', '2004-08-28 12:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(881400, 99118, 656, '<td valign="top">Great choice of angle, good light, fine post processing.  The hair seems to have lost some texture/ structure which can look a bit odd but the rest is great.   9</td>', 'Great choice of angle, good light, fine post processing.  The hair seems to have lost some texture/ structure which can look a bit odd but the rest is great.   9', '2004-08-28 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(881401, 98207, 656, '<td valign="top">works for me.  9</td>', 'works for me.  9', '2004-08-28 12:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(881402, 99414, 656, '<td valign="top">Very cute expressions and technically well executed. 7</td>', 'Very cute expressions and technically well executed. 7', '2004-08-28 12:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(881404, 99115, 656, '<td valign="top">Graphically strong composition, particularly with the blue towel/ slash.</td>', 'Graphically strong composition, particularly with the blue towel/ slash.', '2004-08-28 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
