(881407, 98992, 656, '<td valign="top">Very cool high key shot.  Maybe the hair trailing over the shoulder is not ''in line'' with the rest of the flow but that''s about all.  Quite like the framing too.  8</td>', 'Very cool high key shot.  Maybe the hair trailing over the shoulder is not ''in line'' with the rest of the flow but that''s about all.  Quite like the framing too.  8', '2004-08-28 12:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(881433, 99257, 7560, '<td valign="top">My hands down favorite for this challenge. The lighting is great, and I love the slight pink in the clouds. I love the feeling of energy from the model and the whimsical title. The model''s physical condition has the feel of a classical Greek or Roman statue, which lends to the appeal of the image. I really just love the feeling of unrestrained joy. Excellent job. One I''d love to have for my walls. 10</td>', 'My hands down favorite for this challenge. The lighting is great, and I love the slight pink in the clouds. I love the feeling of energy from the model and the whimsical title. The model''s physical condition has the feel of a classical Greek or Roman statue, which lends to the appeal of the image. I really just love the feeling of unrestrained joy. Excellent job. One I''d love to have for my walls. 10', '2004-08-28 12:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(881434, 99117, 7560, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea actually. I''m not sure I like the lighting as well as I might.</td>', 'An interesting idea actually. I''m not sure I like the lighting as well as I might.', '2004-08-28 12:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(881437, 98655, 7560, '<td valign="top">Classic. A pose straight off a Greek urn. IGreat positioning of the model. I''d be interested to see how this looks with a yellow/gold tone to the modes (like you''d see on some of the vases). But even without the color change- this is beautifully done. 10</td>', 'Classic. A pose straight off a Greek urn. IGreat positioning of the model. I''d be interested to see how this looks with a yellow/gold tone to the modes (like you''d see on some of the vases). But even without the color change- this is beautifully done. 10', '2004-08-28 12:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(881444, 99115, 7560, '<td valign="top">My favorites of the shower shots. :) Excellent framing, and the embossed glass adds a wonderful element of mystery. Good use of strong lines, both horizontal, vertical and the addition of the diagonal towel. Well done. 8</td>', 'My favorites of the shower shots. :) Excellent framing, and the embossed glass adds a wonderful element of mystery. Good use of strong lines, both horizontal, vertical and the addition of the diagonal towel. Well done. 8', '2004-08-28 13:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(881458, 98563, 7560, '<td valign="top">My original kneejerk reaction here was- not nude. :) But coming back and pondering it a bit, I''m drawn in to the subtle nature of the image. I like the toning and slightly high key look. The curve of the body creates a great leading line in the image. The more I look, the more I like. From a 5 to a 9. :)</td>', 'My original kneejerk reaction here was- not nude. :) But coming back and pondering it a bit, I''m drawn in to the subtle nature of the image. I like the toning and slightly high key look. The curve of the body creates a great leading line in the image. The more I look, the more I like. From a 5 to a 9. :)', '2004-08-28 13:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
