(882516, 98348, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 9 <br/>Subject Appeal: 10<br/>Compositional Appeal: 10<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 10<br/>Creativity: 10<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 8 <br/>Title: 8<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This is a great photo.  The composition you chose works nicely to create some universal appeal... excellent work :)<br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 9 Subject Appeal: 10Compositional Appeal: 10Effective use of color/bw: 10Creativity: 10Theme/Storytelling qualities: 8 Title: 8 Additional Comments: This is a great photo.  The composition you chose works nicely to create some universal appeal... excellent work :)', '2004-08-29 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
