(882519, 99420, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 8<br/>Subject Appeal: 9<br/>Compositional Appeal: 8<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 8<br/>Creativity: 10<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 10<br/>Title: 7<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>This is one of the better and more effective uses of selective desaturation that I have seen recently.  The nice light and the softness add quite a bit to the storyline in this photo... excellent work...<br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 8Subject Appeal: 9Compositional Appeal: 8Effective use of color/bw: 8Creativity: 10Theme/Storytelling qualities: 10Title: 7 Additional Comments: This is one of the better and more effective uses of selective desaturation that I have seen recently.  The nice light and the softness add quite a bit to the storyline in this photo... excellent work...', '2004-08-29 14:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(882523, 99407, 772, '<td valign="top">Setzler Comment:<br/> <br/>Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order<br/> <br/>Visual Appeal: 10<br/>Subject Appeal: 8<br/>Compositional Appeal: 8<br/>Effective use of color/bw: 10<br/>Creativity: 10<br/>Theme/Storytelling qualities: 10<br/>Title: 7<br/> <br/>Additional Comments:<br/> <br/>Excellent shot.  I can''t really add any suggestions for improvement :)<br/></td>', 'Setzler Comment: Some general ratings (1-10):  These are some elements that I look for in great photographs, in no specific order Visual Appeal: 10Subject Appeal: 8Compositional Appeal: 8Effective use of color/bw: 10Creativity: 10Theme/Storytelling qualities: 10Title: 7 Additional Comments: Excellent shot.  I can''t really add any suggestions for improvement :)', '2004-08-29 14:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
