(882813, 99093, 4007, '<td valign="top">Mildly amusing, but little artistic value.  Overlapping the border was a good idea, but your cutting job along the arms is very rough and looks pretty bad.</td>', 'Mildly amusing, but little artistic value.  Overlapping the border was a good idea, but your cutting job along the arms is very rough and looks pretty bad.', '2004-08-29 19:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(882816, 98325, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression on his face (and the way you''ve framed it), but this needs to be quite a bit sharper all around.  I''m not sure about the pose either, since it seems to feature his armpit rather prominently, and there might be better approaches.</td>', 'I really like the expression on his face (and the way you''ve framed it), but this needs to be quite a bit sharper all around.  I''m not sure about the pose either, since it seems to feature his armpit rather prominently, and there might be better approaches.', '2004-08-29 19:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
