(883247, 99354, 12268, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for all your great comments! My models were very pleased with there shots. I have somee really great outtakes that I got to play with thru-out the week. Some really nice shots. Folks at the models'' offices loved them so much some want pics with their loved ones! May get some mini jobs out of this still!<br/> <br/>I hope to post some of the outtakes soon. Meanwhile, thanks again!<br/>peace<br/>Rooster!</td>', 'Thanks everyone for all your great comments! My models were very pleased with there shots. I have somee really great outtakes that I got to play with thru-out the week. Some really nice shots. Folks at the models'' offices loved them so much some want pics with their loved ones! May get some mini jobs out of this still! I hope to post some of the outtakes soon. Meanwhile, thanks again!peaceRooster!', '2004-08-30 01:37:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(883250, 99335, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 17th placing. For this contest, top 20 is good. This challenge ran real hot. Very good work and keep hammering away.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 17th placing. For this contest, top 20 is good. This challenge ran real hot. Very good work and keep hammering away.', '2004-08-30 01:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
