(883254, 99020, 16790, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the great comments... I actually didn''t notice the yellow at all until after it was mentioned.  I would assume it''s due to a mixture of bad lighting and my own uneven skin tone.  I''m surprised this ended up doing as well as it did, though! :)</td>', 'Thanks for all of the great comments... I actually didn''t notice the yellow at all until after it was mentioned.  I would assume it''s due to a mixture of bad lighting and my own uneven skin tone.  I''m surprised this ended up doing as well as it did, though! :)', '2004-08-30 01:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(883257, 99418, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 19th placing. hey, top 20 is good with this one. It ran real hot. Your entry is very entertaining.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 19th placing. hey, top 20 is good with this one. It ran real hot. Your entry is very entertaining.', '2004-08-30 01:40:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(883259, 99257, 25464, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your high score.  This was my number 2 choice.  By the way, nice buns.</td>', 'Congratulations on your high score.  This was my number 2 choice.  By the way, nice buns.', '2004-08-30 01:40:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(883263, 98372, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 20th placing. This study sets off a mood.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 20th placing. This study sets off a mood.', '2004-08-30 01:42:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(883283, 99407, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nude isn''t all about private parts folks! ;-) <br/>Thanks for all of the positive comments, I greatly appreciate it.  Azrifel suggested a square crop, maybe that would be better, I''ll try that, thanks!  Otherwise I was trying to balance the photo with my composition, having the clean heaven at the top against the dark ground at the bottom.<br/>The idea was that the man is standing there like on a top of a peak nearest to the almighty, hoping to find some answers for his questions; "what is the meaning of life?", "what is the naked truth?" (I shortened it to "The naked truth?").  I understand that people couldn''t get the idea, but on the other hand, the model is butt-naked, that shouldn''t be questioned or doubted. Have a nice day, yehaaa...!</td>', 'Nude isn''t all about private parts folks! ;-) Thanks for all of the positive comments, I greatly appreciate it.  Azrifel suggested a square crop, maybe that would be better, I''ll try that, thanks!  Otherwise I was trying to balance the photo with my composition, having the clean heaven at the top against the dark ground at the bottom.The idea was that the man is standing there like on a top of a peak nearest to the almighty, hoping to find some answers for his questions; "what is the meaning of life?", "what is the naked truth?" (I shortened it to "The naked truth?").  I understand that people couldn''t get the idea, but on the other hand, the model is butt-naked, that shouldn''t be questioned or doubted. Have a nice day, yehaaa...!', '2004-08-30 01:50:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(883299, 98850, 6349, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought when I saw this was "Bond, James Bond."  This should have done much better than it did.  I''m proud to add this to my favorites (it''s an astounding image and I get to prove that I am completely secure in my heterosexuality)</td>', 'The first thing I thought when I saw this was "Bond, James Bond."  This should have done much better than it did.  I''m proud to add this to my favorites (it''s an astounding image and I get to prove that I am completely secure in my heterosexuality)', '2004-08-30 01:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(883341, 99123, 14819, '<td valign="top">this and the wings were the only photos that stood out to me in this challange.  This one was AWESOME to DA MAX!</td>', 'this and the wings were the only photos that stood out to me in this challange.  This one was AWESOME to DA MAX!', '2004-08-30 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
