(883453, 99252, 11078, '<td valign="top">Congrats Heida This was my pick and my only 10 <br/>This is just beautiful You are amazing with that camera.<br/>Great work!</td>', 'Congrats Heida This was my pick and my only 10 This is just beautiful You are amazing with that camera.Great work!', '2004-08-30 03:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(883465, 99365, 2764, '<td valign="top">how odd - I thought this was an interesting image - i''m one of those sevens - I still think it is an interesting image (except for that spot of red betwen the legs)  Perhaps John is right, try it in black and white and see if it becomes more abstract.</td>', 'how odd - I thought this was an interesting image - i''m one of those sevens - I still think it is an interesting image (except for that spot of red betwen the legs)  Perhaps John is right, try it in black and white and see if it becomes more abstract.', '2004-08-30 03:43:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(883477, 98655, 4008, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Shiiizzzam, and all others who left comments. I didn''t really expect a ribbon, but am slightly disappointed it is not in top 10. I guess I''ll have to do some less strong coloring next time and use a female model. I''ll look at it positively, it is still a yellow ribbon if you only take the male models.</td>', 'Thanks, Shiiizzzam, and all others who left comments. I didn''t really expect a ribbon, but am slightly disappointed it is not in top 10. I guess I''ll have to do some less strong coloring next time and use a female model. I''ll look at it positively, it is still a yellow ribbon if you only take the male models.', '2004-08-30 03:55:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(883479, 99252, 9913, '<td valign="top">Congrada on your 10th and definatly not your last Ribbon.</td>', 'Congrada on your 10th and definatly not your last Ribbon.', '2004-08-30 03:58:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(883480, 98850, 4008, '<td valign="top">This is way underrated, should have ended much, much higher.</td>', 'This is way underrated, should have ended much, much higher.', '2004-08-30 03:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
