(883525, 99123, 22644, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see you with a blue. I was wondering how come you haven''t got one yet. Good job!</td>', 'It''s good to see you with a blue. I was wondering how come you haven''t got one yet. Good job!', '2004-08-30 04:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(883527, 99174, 5728, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments, especially those who took the time to look a little longer at this image and understood what I was portraying.<br/> <br/>This image depicts an unhappy angel who is sad because she is putting on weight, which of course she is not. The story here is that even angels are human and possess human characteristics.<br/>Those who didn''t understand it, it wasn''t that difficult really, but I would recommend you spending a little more time studying a photo and asking yourself what is the meaning here, or what is the photographer saying through this photograph. And some comments were saying the wings are out of place. Angels do have wings!</td>', 'Thank you for your comments, especially those who took the time to look a little longer at this image and understood what I was portraying. This image depicts an unhappy angel who is sad because she is putting on weight, which of course she is not. The story here is that even angels are human and possess human characteristics.Those who didn''t understand it, it wasn''t that difficult really, but I would recommend you spending a little more time studying a photo and asking yourself what is the meaning here, or what is the photographer saying through this photograph. And some comments were saying the wings are out of place. Angels do have wings!', '2004-08-30 04:51:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(883558, 99252, 16493, '<td valign="top">Congrats Heida, truly amazeing photo.<br/> <br/>So many thought my picture was yours. It was so much fun.</td>', 'Congrats Heida, truly amazeing photo. So many thought my picture was yours. It was so much fun.', '2004-08-30 06:06:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(883562, 99407, 12061, '<td valign="top">OMG I can''t believe you weren''t at least in the top ten .... wow .. Its funny cause I looked at the first two pages and thought - Oh No! It must''ve been disqualified :( Then low and behold I find in at a 5.7 ... tsk tsk .. I don''t understand why 100 people would give this ONLY a 5. I''m sorry it didn''t work out as well as I''m sure you were hoping ... better luck next time and keep it up :)</td>', 'OMG I can''t believe you weren''t at least in the top ten .... wow .. Its funny cause I looked at the first two pages and thought - Oh No! It must''ve been disqualified :( Then low and behold I find in at a 5.7 ... tsk tsk .. I don''t understand why 100 people would give this ONLY a 5. I''m sorry it didn''t work out as well as I''m sure you were hoping ... better luck next time and keep it up :)', '2004-08-30 06:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(883563, 98902, 5728, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top favourites for this challenge, I thought it would do much better than 15th. But then again there were a lot of surprises in this challenge!<br/>Congrats man! It''s going into my favourites.</td>', 'This was one of my top favourites for this challenge, I thought it would do much better than 15th. But then again there were a lot of surprises in this challenge!Congrats man! It''s going into my favourites.', '2004-08-30 06:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(883567, 98721, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congrats! You are moving fast, a ribbon in your 4th challange, that''s very good, bet it won''t be your last.  I saw from the Vanishing Point challange that you have great potiental. <br/>Shoot on.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-30 16:18:19.</i></td>', 'Congrats! You are moving fast, a ribbon in your 4th challange, that''s very good, bet it won''t be your last.  I saw from the Vanishing Point challange that you have great potiental. Shoot on.', '2004-08-30 06:21:25.000000', '2004-08-30 17:18:19.000000', 0),
(883571, 98721, 12061, '<td valign="top">You totally deserve this, Congratulations!!! I knew you would make it =D</td>', 'You totally deserve this, Congratulations!!! I knew you would make it =D', '2004-08-30 06:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(883572, 98255, 18722, '<td valign="top">I have been seeing shapes in a number of things lately; grain on the ceiling, in wood, tree branches and of course clouds and such.  It has made start looking at things from a minimalist''s perspective -- just how much detail is needed to get the idea across? -- that sort of thing.<br/> <br/>Then I see this image, and it is nearly a perfect example of just that.  There are a couple of things I wonder about though.  I know you mentioned you tried it with and without stocking, but did you perhaps try it with stockings with less of a solid feel to them -- closer to fishnet, but not quite there.  The black is just a bit over-whelming.  The second thing I didn''t care for is more of a personal matter -- I don''t care for grain -- but beyond that, I feel it detracted from the minimalistic feel of the image.<br/> <br/>But, we each have our own ideas of how we like things.<br/> <br/>David</td>', 'I have been seeing shapes in a number of things lately; grain on the ceiling, in wood, tree branches and of course clouds and such.  It has made start looking at things from a minimalist''s perspective -- just how much detail is needed to get the idea across? -- that sort of thing. Then I see this image, and it is nearly a perfect example of just that.  There are a couple of things I wonder about though.  I know you mentioned you tried it with and without stocking, but did you perhaps try it with stockings with less of a solid feel to them -- closer to fishnet, but not quite there.  The black is just a bit over-whelming.  The second thing I didn''t care for is more of a personal matter -- I don''t care for grain -- but beyond that, I feel it detracted from the minimalistic feel of the image. But, we each have our own ideas of how we like things. David', '2004-08-30 06:29:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(883576, 99123, 19158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! this blue is much more than deserved! Seeing shoots like yours makes me want to be your model instead being behind my camera! everything seems to be just... BEAUTIFUL.</td>', 'Congratulations! this blue is much more than deserved! Seeing shoots like yours makes me want to be your model instead being behind my camera! everything seems to be just... BEAUTIFUL.', '2004-08-30 06:51:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(883581, 98992, 10390, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect your photo to win a ribbon maybe, but very close to that, I would have placed it higher, I rated it among 8 highest photos and I thought your photo would end up in about 5th place. I guess your photo suffered from the same thing as mine (although mine suffered a lot for that I think, it would have done well in a "silhouettes" challenge maybe :-)), the lack of flesh and private parts, come on folks, you dirty you! (hehe)  I think that the challenge''s theme allowed much more than just a typical nude shot, the details didn''t say much at least.  <br/>Well, it''s a shame that your photo didn''t score higher, congrats on the outcome of the photo at least, its very nice, got good tonings, is well lit, and has very good composition and not at least it conveys the challenge''s theme perfectly!<br/> <br/>ps. thanks for your kind words on my submission for this challenge, it helped making it worth the effort. -clic</td>', 'I didn''t expect your photo to win a ribbon maybe, but very close to that, I would have placed it higher, I rated it among 8 highest photos and I thought your photo would end up in about 5th place. I guess your photo suffered from the same thing as mine (although mine suffered a lot for that I think, it would have done well in a "silhouettes" challenge maybe :-)), the lack of flesh and private parts, come on folks, you dirty you! (hehe)  I think that the challenge''s theme allowed much more than just a typical nude shot, the details didn''t say much at least.  Well, it''s a shame that your photo didn''t score higher, congrats on the outcome of the photo at least, its very nice, got good tonings, is well lit, and has very good composition and not at least it conveys the challenge''s theme perfectly! ps. thanks for your kind words on my submission for this challenge, it helped making it worth the effort. -clic', '2004-08-30 07:20:42.000000', NULL, 0),
