(883617, 98721, 16301, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon! <br/> <br/>Two things I noticed here and were distracting to me:<br/>1- The shadow on the sheet.<br/>2- The folds on the sheet and the pink color it had.<br/> <br/>I think it would have been flawless with a black sheet instead. The pose is excellent. I still gave the photo a 7 though.<br/> <br/>Good luck...<br/> <br/>- Thamer</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon!  Two things I noticed here and were distracting to me:1- The shadow on the sheet.2- The folds on the sheet and the pink color it had. I think it would have been flawless with a black sheet instead. The pose is excellent. I still gave the photo a 7 though. Good luck... - Thamer', '2004-08-30 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
