(883706, 99407, 2780, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo a 5, which is the highest mark I ever give for a photo that (in my opinion) doesn''t fit the theme of the challenge. How do I know the person is nude? They could be wearing clothes for all I know. It just didnt fit my perception of the nude challenge. <br/> <br/>In a free study challenge I probably would have given it 8. I like the colouring and the sky and the pose, but it think it goes too dark too quick at the bottom. I would have preferred to see a more gradual fade to black so that more of the hill/mountain could be visible.</td>', 'I gave this photo a 5, which is the highest mark I ever give for a photo that (in my opinion) doesn''t fit the theme of the challenge. How do I know the person is nude? They could be wearing clothes for all I know. It just didnt fit my perception of the nude challenge.  In a free study challenge I probably would have given it 8. I like the colouring and the sky and the pose, but it think it goes too dark too quick at the bottom. I would have preferred to see a more gradual fade to black so that more of the hill/mountain could be visible.', '2004-08-30 10:09:34.000000', NULL, 0),
