(884152, 99240, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>Let me start out by saying very nice entry for this challenge.  Beautifully done and very emotional in it''s own right.  The lighting here is exceptional and compliments the contrasts of your skintones nicely.<br/> <br/>As I look at it I can''t help but wish your girlfriend was looking either down at your arms protecting her or straight at the camera, just one of those things that is hindsight.<br/> <br/>Again I am gonna say fantastic shot and well done.</td>', 'Critique Club Let me start out by saying very nice entry for this challenge.  Beautifully done and very emotional in it''s own right.  The lighting here is exceptional and compliments the contrasts of your skintones nicely. As I look at it I can''t help but wish your girlfriend was looking either down at your arms protecting her or straight at the camera, just one of those things that is hindsight. Again I am gonna say fantastic shot and well done.', '2004-08-30 15:09:51.000000', NULL, 0),
