(885865, 99174, 15832, '<td valign="top">Hi kiwi.<br/> <br/>I didn´t vote on this challenge because i´ve had alot to do the last days but i´ve know this would have bin one of my fav.<br/>The skin tone is perfect and the angel from both side is really nice.<br/>I dont understand why some people didn´t gave it more time but than again.<br/>I´m expirensing something like that with my hope pic.<br/>(Not nearly as good and professonal as this one but people are commentig against things that i did for a reason, not seeing my point)<br/>Congrats with the 9th place <br/></td>', 'Hi kiwi. I didn´t vote on this challenge because i´ve had alot to do the last days but i´ve know this would have bin one of my fav.The skin tone is perfect and the angel from both side is really nice.I dont understand why some people didn´t gave it more time but than again.I´m expirensing something like that with my hope pic.(Not nearly as good and professonal as this one but people are commentig against things that i did for a reason, not seeing my point)Congrats with the 9th place ', '2004-08-31 19:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
