(1614925, 99020, 16790, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zeissman:</b></div><hr/><i> yeah, a picture of big boobs will be very helpful for women...... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You entirely missed the point.  The photo displays almost everything that is supposed to be despised by women about ourselves - too much weight, veins, uneven skin tone - in a straight forward, simplistic manner, without diminishing the subject (I do not for the life of me understand how people can be the "fat one" on diet pill commercials and such).<br/> <br/>Some people get it, I guess, and some don''t.</td>', 'Originally posted by Zeissman: yeah, a picture of big boobs will be very helpful for women......   You entirely missed the point.  The photo displays almost everything that is supposed to be despised by women about ourselves - too much weight, veins, uneven skin tone - in a straight forward, simplistic manner, without diminishing the subject (I do not for the life of me understand how people can be the "fat one" on diet pill commercials and such). Some people get it, I guess, and some don''t.', '2005-08-16 15:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
